-- Phase 2b of the NPC / bestiary work, first half: the gods, demon lords and
-- other named beings Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods stats, plus Underseas'
-- Kraken - rows for notable_npcs (migration 072) and their attacks in
-- stat_attacks (migration 073). Pantheons of the Megaverse follows separately.
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration.
--
-- FOUND by the filing rule of migration 072: a stat block with a Real Name line
-- or a numeric experience level is a notable NPC. Dragon SPECIES (pp.21-81),
-- race templates (Ramen, Phoenixi, Tautons), minion types and rune weapons
-- are not - they wait for Phase 3's creatures table or are items.
--
-- EXTRACTED by seven book-extract-workers, every number read off a 200 dpi
-- render rather than the OCR cache - the text layer carries the digit cipher -
-- and every printed folio checked against scripts/books.json. RECONCILED by
-- book-reconcile against the renders, row by row; its corrections are applied.
--
-- WHAT A ROW HOLDS. The book's numbers, as printed. A god may print only some
-- attributes (Kalba's physical ones follow the body he wears): those keys are
-- absent, never invented. Deific powers and Rifts Earth M.D.C. conversions are
-- in bonuses_note. The Four Demon Beetles share one printed block and are one
-- row. description, disposition and natural_abilities are short paraphrases -
-- no sentence is the book's.
--
--   node scripts/d1-apply.mjs --local apps/character-creator/db/add-notable-npcs-dragons-and-gods.sql
--
-- BY BOOK:
--   Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods (73): Aco, The Juggernaut, Algor, Chantico,
--     Rurga, Cirga, Panath, Kalba, Lista, Kirgi, Utu, Vald-Tegor, Tolmet, Osiris, Ra,
--     Thoth, Isis, Horus, Bennu, Apis, Set, Anubis, Apepi, Amon, Anhur, Ammit, Bes,
--     Sebek, Od, Epim, Locknar, Hoknar, Heim, Belimar, Wolvenar, Ippotomi, Lopnel,
--     Pith, Michla-Da, Tark, Yin-Sloth, Sahtalus, Hel, Nidhogg, Mephisto, Nickodeamis,
--     Leviathan, Rhada, Diabolus, Modeus, Andras, Rabdos, Kubera-Loe, Mictla,
--     Succor-Bemoth, Charun, Abdul-Ra, Random, Belphegor, The Four Demon Beetles,
--     Mantus, Mania, Murmur, Ramsea, Mormo, Abrasax, High Lord Erloc, Lady Leeves,
--     Powmer, Kym-nark-mar, Zandragal, Kormath, Styphon
--   Rifts World Book 7: Underseas (1): The Lord of the Deep

  'aco', 'Aco', NULL, NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '15th level Warlock and 12th level Priest of Light', 15, 'Anarchist (selfish)', NULL, '11 feet (3.4 meters)', NULL, '{"IQ":24,"ME":29,"MA":28,"PS":28,"PP":30,"PE":27,"PB":39,"Spd":77}', 4220, 4500, NULL, 3600, NULL, 11, 17, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":5}', 'Attacks: 6 physical or 2 magical per melee (not both); +9 to save vs horror factor/awe; 99% to charm or impress; Rifts Earth M.D.C. 7,800 (Armor of Usa M.D.C. 6,000, protects vs energy weapons)', NULL, 'Omniscient in astronomy and mathematics (all), as goddess of the sky', 'Astral travel, flight, unlimited darkness/nightvision, sees aura, invisible at will, knows all languages, bio-regenerates, teleports 99%, dimensional teleport 98%, humanoid shapeshift; deific powers: shield followers in darkness, darken night sky, remove a god''s power.', 'All air elemental spells levels 1-8; All other elemental spells levels 1-4; Understands all symbols, wards, curses, circles of protection and summoning', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Armor of Usa (worn only during deific conflict; A.R. 18, S.D.C. 2,000, +5 vs psionics, +4 vs magic, +10 vs poison, regens 1D6x10 S.D.C./hour)', NULL, 'Reclusive protector goddess devoted to hiding worshippers, especially children and the vulnerable; vanishes completely when offended.', 'Juggernaut; Utu; Gods of Light (sometimes); Northern Gods (sometimes); Pantheon of Rurga (sometimes)', 'Anhur; Bes; Amon; Pith; Yin-Sloth; Deevil Lords', 'Reclusive Palladium World goddess of darkness and concealment, protector of children and the helpless, closely bonded to the Juggernaut.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.98-99');
  'juggernaut', 'The Juggernaut', NULL, NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '18th level Soldier, 12th level Gladiator, 9th level Sailor', 18, 'Unprincipled (selfish)', NULL, '14 feet (4.2 meters); can alter size', NULL, '{"IQ":13,"ME":18,"MA":12,"PS":50,"PP":30,"PE":33,"PB":30,"Spd":88}', 730, 4810, NULL, 3450, 110, 12, 14, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":5,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"roll":3,"pull":6}', '+6 vs poison; impervious to horror factor; innate self-healing/resurrection, can never truly die (Cost: Free); Rifts Earth M.D.C. 6,600', '[{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":80},{"name":"Cooking","pct":94}]', 'Godlike in all hand to hand combat (15th level, any style); all military and competitive physical skills 94%; all W.P.s at 10th level', 'Astral travel, hawk vision (2 miles), sees invisible, turns invisible, knows all languages, teleports 92%, dimensional teleport 41%, resistant to heat/cold/fire, bio-regenerates, shapeshifts animal/humanoid.', NULL, 'Commune with animals; Commune with spirits', NULL, NULL, 'None favored; fights unarmed or uses ordinary soldier''s gear, or rune/magic weapons of opportunity when fighting other gods', NULL, 'Loyal, simple-minded, incorruptible warrior devoted to Aco; enjoys sport and camaraderie, occasionally drinks to excess.', 'Aco; Hoknar; Lopnel; other war gods', 'Anhur; Bes; Amon; Pith; Yin-Sloth; Deevil Lords', 'Palladium World god of strength, athletics and the sun; Aco''s devoted companion, virtually indestructible, patron of athletes and gladiators.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.99-100');
  'algor', 'Algor', 'Algorath Splainiisa''th', 'The Giant, Male God of the Sea', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '17th level air and water Warlock, 12th level Mercenary, and 10th level Bard', 17, 'Anarchist (selfish)', NULL, '60 feet (20 meters)', NULL, '{"IQ":22,"ME":36,"MA":23,"PS":40,"PP":24,"PE":30,"PB":17,"Spd":19}', 9000, 14000, NULL, 2500, 180, 14, 17, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":6,"strike":4,"parry":1,"dodge":1,"pull":5}', 'Deific powers: create/control storm pocket, control the sea, create deific realm (all prototypical deific powers at half cost); +12 vs horror factor; 3 attacks per melee if using magic instead of physical; foes need an 18 or higher to save vs Algor''s magic; Rifts Earth M.D.C. 11,500 (half damage from mega-damage weapons; only plasma, nuclear and magic do full)', '[{"name":"Singing","pct":85},{"name":"Astronomy & Navigation","pct":96},{"name":"Ice Sculpture","pct":89}]', 'All naval skills at 12th level of experience', 'Astral travel 94%, breathes underwater without limit, impervious to cold/pressure, swims 98%, unlimited nightvision, sees/turns invisible, knows all languages, never fatigues, bio-regenerates, teleports, shapeshifts animal/humanoid/elemental.', 'All elemental magic spells; All symbols, wards, curses, circles of protection and summoning', 'All physical and sensitive psionics; Induce sleep; Psychic diagnosis; Hydrokinesis; Mental illusion; Mind wipe; Telemechanics', NULL, NULL, 'Gjaallk, The Soul-Breaker (greater rune sword and soul drinker, sentient diabolic Diabolist, +4 to strike, 8D6+8 damage); Algor''s Ice Armor (spell-armor; A.R. 19, S.D.C. 1,000; 200 P.P.E. to cast; reintegrates for 100 P.P.E. near water)', NULL, 'Selfish, greedy, childish and quick to anger when thwarted; reclusive but occasionally intervenes decisively in wars among gods.', 'Od; Belimar; Kormath (dragon god)', 'Deevil Lords (historically)', 'Colossal Palladium World sea god who shaped the world''s oceans and volcanoes; a reclusive, greedy Northern God worshipped by sailors.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.102-103');
  'chantico', 'Chantico', 'Chantico Lesthanth Io', NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '9th level Assassin and 6th level Wizard', 9, 'Aberrant (evil)', NULL, '6 feet (2 meters) tall, 12 feet (4 meters) long (dog form)', NULL, '{"IQ":16,"ME":19,"MA":16,"PS":28,"PP":29,"PE":26,"PB":8,"Spd":66}', 1900, 2150, NULL, 360, NULL, 12, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":4,"strike":5,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"roll":3,"pull":3}', 'Deific power: Possess Follower (75 P.P.E.; -20% to skills while possessing; possessed follower risks permanent insanity afterward, 1-33% chance); +2 vs psionics, +6 vs magic, +6 vs poison, +11 vs horror factor; critical strike on natural 18+; triple damage from backstab; P.B. reduced to 8 (was 25) by his transformation; takes only half damage from ordinary physical attacks, double from silver/Holy Weapons; Rifts Earth M.D.C. 1,200, can assume human-like form 2D4x10 minutes/day there', '[{"name":"Recognize Weapon Quality","pct":88},{"name":"Surveillance","pct":60},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":60},{"name":"Interrogation","pct":50},{"name":"Prowl","pct":50},{"name":"Lore: Demons & Monsters","pct":72},{"name":"Lore: Geomancy & Ley Lines","pct":90},{"name":"Lore: Religion","pct":97}]', NULL, 'Astral travel 33%, nightvision 100ft, knows all languages, booming voice, tracks by smell 50%, prowls 80%, sees invisible, teleports 88% (4x/day), dimensional teleport 32%, summons/controls 2D6+3 wild dogs.', 'All Wizard spells, levels 1-3', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bitter, arrogant and vengeful; obsessively hates all gods and sees himself as a symbol of injustice, cursed into dog form.', NULL, 'Isis; Thoth; virtually every god he has heard of', 'Demigod cursed into permanent dog form for a transgression against the Gods of Light; leads a small, fanatical assassin cult.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.104-105');
  'rurga', 'Rurga', 'Titia op''Rurga', 'Warrior Goddess', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '20th level Palladin and 10th level Psychic Sensitive', 20, 'Principled (good)', NULL, '12 feet (4 meters)', NULL, '{"IQ":23,"ME":24,"MA":27,"PS":31,"PP":31,"PE":29,"PB":29,"Spd":27}', 2880, 3000, NULL, 650, 295, 10, 13, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"roll":4,"pull":8}', 'Deific powers: automatically detect a lie (free), merge into a living tree (10 P.P.E.; an hour in a tree equals a full night''s rest and regenerates HP/SDC/ISP plus 4D6 PPE), adopt a new weapon (100 P.P.E.); 96% to charm/impress; impervious to horror factor; +2 on all other saves; armor A.R. 18 (S.D.C. 400); Rifts Earth M.D.C. 8,000', '[{"name":"Play Panpipes","pct":89},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":98},{"name":"Detect Concealment & Traps","pct":98},{"name":"Escape Artist","pct":90},{"name":"Track Animals","pct":98},{"name":"Track Humanoids","pct":85},{"name":"Horsemanship: Palladin","pct":98},{"name":"Horsemanship: Exotic Animals","pct":90},{"name":"Animal Husbandry","pct":98}]', 'Falconry, field armorer, military etiquette, recognize weapon quality, and all wilderness skills, each at 98%', 'Astral travel 96%, tracks/identifies tracks, prowls 80%, nightvision 120ft, master palladin horsemanship (15th level), bio-regenerates, sees/turns invisible, knows all languages, teleports 90%, shapeshifts animal/humanoid.', NULL, 'All Psychic Sensitive powers; Sense Psychic & Magic Energy; Sense Supernatural Beings; Advanced Trance State; Mind Block Auto-Defense; Psi-Shield; Psi-Sword', NULL, NULL, 'Vlaa the Demon Slayer (lesser rune sword, flamberge form, 6D6+24 damage, double vs demons/undead, indestructible, blinding flash); Coal (magic war hammer, 4D6 damage, returns when thrown); Zelg (magic silver scimitar, 3D6+3 damage); Ekanstall, Rurga''s Silver Plate Armor (A.R. 18, S.D.C. 400)', NULL, 'Rigidly honest, righteous warrior goddess devoted to truth and justice; distrustful of other gods but allies against greater evils.', 'Cirga', 'forces of evil generally', 'Palladium World warrior goddess of truth, war and justice; patron of paladins and knights, leads an undead Dark Army.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.106-109');
  'cirga', 'Cirga', 'Ven teg''Cirga', 'The Bowman, Warrior God', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '19th level Long Bowman', 19, 'Scrupulous (good)', NULL, '12 feet (3.6 meters)', NULL, '{"IQ":19,"ME":25,"MA":25,"PS":30,"PP":28,"PE":26,"PB":25,"Spd":26}', 2400, 1390, NULL, 600, NULL, 10, 10, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', 'Deific powers: rapid unlimited animal metamorphosis (1 P.P.E. each), merge into a living tree (25 P.P.E.), power deific arrow (+4 to strike, 2D6+6 damage, double vs evil/supernatural, triple vs both, 1D6+2/round burning if lodged; 5 P.P.E. per arrow); 12 attacks per melee when firing a bow instead of 7; 93% to charm/impress; +7 vs horror factor; +1 on all other saves; armor A.R. 16 (S.D.C. 350); Rifts Earth M.D.C. 3,780', '[{"name":"Sing","pct":90},{"name":"Dance","pct":92},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":94},{"name":"Escape Artist","pct":87}]', 'Falconry, military etiquette, recognize weapon quality, W.P. paired weapons, W.P. archery, W.P. targeting/missile weapons, and all wilderness skills, each at 98%', 'Charm (as spell), astral travel 87%, identifies/tracks, prowls 80%, hawk-like vision, nightvision 2000ft, sees/turns invisible, knows all languages, bio-regenerates, teleports 84%, shapeshifts animal/humanoid.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Long bow (magic, unbreakable, needs P.S. 21; 2000ft range; normal arrows 2D6, fire arrows 4D6, lightning arrows 6D6); Ren (greater rune dagger, carries all sensitive psionic powers, 5D6+23 damage, double vs supernatural, warns Cirga of danger); Zenok (indestructible spear, boar-stopping crosspiece, 6D6 plus P.S. bonus damage, returns when thrown); Jonas and Jassell (twin magic throwing axes, 4D6 plus P.S. bonus damage each, return when thrown; second auto-hits once first is embedded); Cirga''s Armor (magically enhanced, A.R. 16, S.D.C. 350)', NULL, 'Loyal, impulsive hunter-god devoted hopelessly to Rurga; easily bored and distrustful of other deities after being tricked repeatedly.', 'Rurga', 'Deevil Lords of Dyval', 'Palladium World hunter and warrior god, secondary patron of paladins and archers; Rurga''s loyal but unrequited admirer.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.109-111');
  'panath', 'Panath', 'Lurn teg''Panath', 'Assassin and God of Treachery', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '20th level Assassin and 9th level Mind Mage', 20, 'Miscreant (evil)', NULL, '11 feet (3.5 meters)', NULL, '{"IQ":25,"ME":23,"MA":28,"PS":27,"PP":30,"PE":24,"PB":26,"Spd":27}', 2300, 2300, NULL, 800, 450, 10, 13, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":5,"strike":4,"parry":2,"pull":8}', 'Deific powers: Innocence of Panath (permanent aura of innocence, 20ft radius, free; temporary version for a whole temple, one night), merge into a living tree (12 P.P.E.), manifestation (loses 2 attacks per melee if fighting simultaneously with it, 25 P.P.E.); triple damage on surprise attacks/backstabbing; 97% to charm/impress; impervious to horror factor; +2 on all saving throws; armor A.R. 16 (S.D.C. 280); Rifts Earth M.D.C. 3,840', '[{"name":"Art (Painting)","pct":78},{"name":"Detect Ambush","pct":90},{"name":"Detect Concealment & Traps","pct":90},{"name":"Escape Artist","pct":87},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":94},{"name":"Horsemanship: Knight","pct":95},{"name":"Horsemanship: Exotic Animals","pct":90}]', 'All rogue/thief skills, each at 80%', 'Astral travel 86%, identifies/tracks, prowls 90%, nightvision 1000ft, sees invisible, turns invisible, senses magic 70%, bio-regenerates, knows all languages, teleports 92%, dimensional teleport 75%, shapeshifts animal/humanoid.', NULL, 'All physical psionics; Lust for life; Induce sleep; Psychic purification; Clairvoyance; Empathy; Object read; Telepathy; Catatonic strike; Group mind block; Insert memory; Mind block auto-defense; Telemechanics; Psi-sword', NULL, NULL, 'Flaming Ball and Chain (6D6 damage, ignites flammable materials); Daggers of Panath (1D6 damage plus poison via hidden hilt reservoir, typically +30 damage); Leather armor, magically reinforced (A.R. 16, S.D.C. 280)', NULL, 'Sarcastic, cynical and fatalistic assassin-god; sociable with both good and evil deities despite a reputation for treachery.', 'numerous short-term allies among gods and demons', 'Cirga (disliked, not considered a real threat)', 'Palladium World god of assassins, thieves and treachery; sociable trickster blamed for manipulating his fellow deities'' misfortunes.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.113-114');
  'kalba', 'Kalba', 'Sumiel teg''Kalba', 'Lord of Magic', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '21st level Wizard', 21, 'Aberrant (evil)', NULL, 'Varies according to host body', NULL, '{"IQ":19,"ME":15,"MA":12}', 670, NULL, NULL, 1800, 1590, NULL, 14, '{"attacks":2,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"damage":3}', '+3 on all saving throws while in a body; impervious to horror factor while in a body; up to four psionic or physical attacks per melee round while in a body; hit points +300 while possessing a host; M.D.C. 300 in a body, 600 M.D.C. as a spirit', NULL, NULL, 'As spirit: astral travel, ethereal, invisible, flight, sees without light, all languages, tireless, teleports, immune to physical harm. Can Possess Mortals (50 P.P.E. willing, 250 unwilling). In a host body, abilities are reduced versions of the above.', 'All symbols and wards; All protection circles; 1st-9th level Wizard spells; Banishment; Control & enslave entity; Create mummy; Dimensional pocket; Mystic portal; Summon shadow beast; Anti-magic cloud; Amulet; Protection circle: superior; Crimson wall of Lictalon', 'Any Healing, Physical, or Sensitive Psionics; Bio-manipulation; Cause insanity; Hypnotic suggestion; Induce nightmare; Insert memory; Mental illusion; Mentally possess others; Mind block auto-defense; Mind bolt; Mind bond; Mind wipe; P.P.E. shield; Telemechanics', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Manipulative, desperate wandering spirit hunting for bodies to possess; resentful, obsessed with revenge on Panath.', NULL, 'Panath; unidentified Gods of Darkness', 'A wizard demigod betrayed, slain, and stripped of his body by Panath; his soul now wanders, possessing willing mortals.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.116-117');
  'lista', 'Lista', 'Jolia op''Lista', 'Warrior & Sea Goddess', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '15th level Soldier, 8th level Water Warlock, and 4th level Summoner', 15, 'Anarchist (selfish)', NULL, '10 feet (3 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":21,"ME":16,"MA":19,"PS":34,"PP":27,"PE":26,"PB":30,"Spd":28}', 2850, 2335, NULL, 400, NULL, 10, 12, '{"attacks":5,"initiative":5,"strike":2,"parry":4,"dodge":4}', '+2 on all saving throws; two mystic attacks per melee is an alternative to five physical; Natural A.R. 10, or 16 in armor; Deific Sonic Blast (4D6x10 S.D.C. plus 2D4 hit points underwater), Merge into Living Tree (15 P.P.E.), Summon Entities of the Deep (115 P.P.E.), Deific Curse: God-Blind; M.D.C. 5000 on Rifts Earth', '[{"name":"Sing","pct":84},{"name":"Horsemanship: Knight","pct":93},{"name":"Horsemanship: Exotic Animals","pct":97},{"name":"Marine Biology","pct":48}]', 'All Weapon Proficiencies (except bow); all wilderness skills at 85%', 'Swims 40 mph, breathes water and air, immune to cold/pressure, resists heat/fire/electricity, nightvision 1200 ft, invisibility at will, all languages, tireless, bio-regenerates 4D6/round, teleports, shapeshifts to animal or humanoid.', 'All 1st-5th level water elemental spells; Little Ice Monster; Creature of the Waves; familiar with all circles of summoning and protection; power words; mystic symbols; enchantments', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'K''Khermont (Great Rune Sword, bonds to Principled wielder, Wizard magic entity); Trident (Lista''s own construction); magical Splint Armor (A.R. 16, 200 S.D.C.)', NULL, 'Cold, aloof, self-punishing recluse; passionate with lovers yet emotionally detached; stubborn, growing fond of the sea.', 'Rurga; Cirga; Panath; Kalba; Algor; Sebek', NULL, 'Sea and war goddess, daughter of Rurga, exiled to the ocean depths after corruption by Panath; counsels mortal lovers in battle.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.117-120');
  'kirgi', 'Kirgi', NULL, 'The Rat God', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '10th level Wizard and 10th level Thief', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, 'Typically 6 feet (2 meters) high and 9 feet (3 meters) long; shapechanger, varies', NULL, '{"IQ":29,"ME":29,"MA":23,"PS":22,"PP":26,"PE":26,"PB":7,"Spd":19}', 1850, 2390, NULL, 690, NULL, 14, 15, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":4,"pull":4}', '+6 to save vs horror factor, +2 on all other saving throws; triple damage from behind and surprise attacks; two magic attacks per melee is an alternative to six physical; M.D.C. 1,700 on Rifts Earth', NULL, 'Forgery, climb, swim, land navigation, intelligence, surveillance, ventriloquism, pick pockets, palming, concealment, card shark, streetwise - all at 85%', 'Astral travel, prowl, locates secret doors, tracks humanoids, nightvision 1 mile, invisible at will, bio-regenerates 4D6/round, teleports, shapeshifts animal/humanoid, imitates voices, senses magic, immune to heat/cold/fire, summons 1D6x1000 rats/mice.', 'All 1st-10th level Wizard spells; Remove curse; Create zombie; Metamorphosis: mist; Close Rift; All summoning spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Various off-world bio-wizardry and high-tech weapons (rarely used); Amulets and bracelets of protection', NULL, 'Ambitious, opportunistic trickster; hasty but reined in by his priest-advisor; fascinated by technology and inter-pantheon scheming.', 'Tagamundus; K''Garru; Utu', 'Pantheon of Taut; Chrun; Belphegor; Abrasax', 'Shapeshifting rat-god of deception and thieves, recruiting disaffected Deevil Lords while a priest reforms his once-outlawed cult.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.122-123');
  'utu', 'Utu', 'Utu san''Balasteer', 'Lord of the Dead', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '18th level Psychic Sensitive, 10th level Wizard, and Mercenary Warrior', 18, 'Aberrant (evil)', NULL, '15 feet (5 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":24,"ME":24,"MA":20,"PS":25,"PP":22,"PE":26,"Spd":14}', 4100, 8200, NULL, 680, 1900, 14, 17, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":1,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":6,"pull":7}', '+4 on all other saving throws; impervious to horror factor; three magic attacks per melee is an alternative to six; Resistant to all Attacks (normal weapons, fire, heat, cold, poison, disease, and even magic/holy weapons and supernatural blows do half damage; only psionics have full effect); Call Servant of Hades (free); Stop the Flow of Souls (500 P.P.E.); M.D.C. 5000 on Rifts Earth', '[{"name":"Farming/Gardening","pct":93},{"name":"Rope Works","pct":89},{"name":"Field Armorer","pct":90},{"name":"Horsemanship: General","pct":78},{"name":"Surgeon/Medical Doctor","pct":98},{"name":"Land Navigation","pct":98},{"name":"Astronomy and Navigation","pct":98},{"name":"Skin & Prepare Animal Hides","pct":98}]', 'All math skills at 98%', 'Astral travel, flight 75 mph, nightvision 1 mile, invisible at will, prowl 90%, all languages, tireless, teleports, shapeshifts humanoid (stays hooded), immune to heat/cold/fire/disease/poison, senses ley lines and departed souls.', 'All 1st-8th level Wizard spells; knowledge of all symbols, wards, curses, and circles of protection and summoning', 'All sensitive abilities; Induce sleep; Spontaneous combustion; Catatonic strike; Cause insanity; Hypnotic suggestion; Insert memory', NULL, NULL, 'Scythe (favorite weapon; +10 to strike; ancient artifact)', NULL, 'Solitary, dutiful arbiter of souls; stern and secretive; tolerates no interference with his function.', NULL, 'Deevil Lords; Isis; Thoth; Ra', 'Realmless death-god who personally escorts departing souls, fiercely guards that sole duty, and honors contracts with underworld rulers.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.126-127');
  'vald-tegor', 'Vald-Tegor', 'Baron Valedon Kanoflax Tengor', 'Lord of the Undead', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Vampire Intelligence', '20th level Master Vampire, 8th level Wizard and 6th level Necromancer', 20, 'Diabolic (evil)', NULL, '6.5 feet (2 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":27,"ME":28,"MA":30,"PS":35,"PP":24,"PE":27,"PB":24,"Spd":33}', 13970, 10420, NULL, 2200, 1200, 10, 10, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3}', '+10 to save vs horror factor, +2 other saving throws; +6 to dodge when in bat form; Horror Factor may be as high as 15 on worlds where such entities are uncommon; other vampires resisting his Super-hypnotic suggestion suffer a -12 penalty; M.D.C. 24,000 on Rifts Earth', '[{"name":"Literacy: Dragonese","pct":98}]', 'Politics, Sciences (dabbles in many different areas)', 'Astral travel, hawk-like vision, nightvision 4000 ft, sees infrared/ultraviolet, smells blood 2 miles, all languages, regenerates 4D6/round, charm/love charm/mesmerism, summons bats or dogs/wolves, turns to mist, shapeshifts bat/rat/wolf, immune to normal weapons.', '1st-8th level Wizard spells; curses; circles of protection (both); all Necro-magic spells and powers', 'All Sensitive Psionics; Induce Sleep; Psychic Purification; Spontaneous Combustion; Telekinesis; Telekinetic Leap; Catatonic Strike; Group Mind Block; Insert Memory; Mind Block Auto-Defense; Pyrokinesis; Telemechanics; Super-hypnotic suggestion; telepathic link with minions', NULL, NULL, 'Pole arm collection (includes at least two Rune Weapons); Dagger (carried at all times); Two marbles of transformation (weapons); Two suits of magical plate armor (A.R. 16, 450 S.D.C.); Cloak of guises', NULL, 'Arrogant, controlling noble vampire; maintains order among Palladium''s vampires while posing as their protector.', 'Succor-Bemoth; Utu; Set; Anubis', 'other Vampire Intelligences', 'A vampire intelligence fused with a noble mage; secretly rules and monitors all vampires on the Palladium World.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.129-130');
  'tolmet', 'Tolmet', 'Ss''Tol Ma''Ess''Aa', 'the Cruel', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '12th level Wizard, 9th level Psi-Healer and 7th level Acrobat (Dancer)', 12, 'Diabolic (evil)', NULL, '12 feet (4 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":24,"ME":28,"MA":31,"PS":20,"PP":24,"PE":27,"PB":36,"Spd":33}', 3960, 4850, NULL, 1490, 350, 14, 19, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"pull":5}', '+5 on all saving throws; impervious to horror factor; 98% to charm or impress; three magical attacks per melee is an alternative to six; Poisonous Bite/Kiss, Poisonous Nails (+4D6 damage, save vs poison 14), Create Quidnunc (1050 P.P.E.); M.D.C. 4900 on Rifts Earth', '[{"name":"Dance","pct":98}]', 'Hand to hand: assassin, paired weapons; all skills needed to pass as a lady in a royal court at 85%', 'Flight 75 mph, sees auras, unlimited nightvision 2 miles, invisible at will, all languages (poetic/sarcastic/rhythmic), senses magic 85%, teleports, regenerates 6D6/round, shapeshifts humanoid, commands demons 85%.', 'All Wizard spells 1st-10th level; Anti-magic cloud; Create magic scroll; Finger of Lictalon; Amulet; Summon & control entity; Create golem; Sanctum; Talisman; Restoration; Summon greater familiar; Crimson wall of Lictalon', 'All Psionic Healing abilities; Alter aura; Sixth sense; Induce nightmares; Mind bond', NULL, NULL, 'Seth-blade (soul-drinking rune dagger)', NULL, 'Cruel, vain, and patient goddess of death; craves praise of her virtues, spares children and crime victims, seeks a dominant faith.', 'Rabdos the Strangler; Lictalon', 'Charun; Mania; Lords of Dyval', 'Bloodthirsty death goddess formed from a merged Old One spirit and a girl who survived immolation; demands sacrifice and torment.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.131-133');
  'osiris', 'Osiris', NULL, 'The Lawgiver', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', NULL, NULL, 'Principled', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Low-level wizards/priests holding any part of Osiris cast spells/prayers as if 8th level', NULL, NULL, 'No natural abilities printed; his power now resides entirely in his 14 scattered, indestructible magic body parts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The 14 Parts of Osiris: right hand, right index finger, left hand, left foot, rib cage, right eye, left eye, right femur, left femur, tongue, skull, lungs, kidney, heart', NULL, 'Passive, slain god; no longer acts directly, only through the magic relics of his dismembered body.', 'Isis', 'Set; Anubis', 'Slain Egyptian sun/law deity, murdered and cut into 14 pieces by his brother Set; Isis seeks his scattered relics.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.137');
  'ra', 'Ra', 'Ra Annu', 'Lord of Light', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '20th level Warlock of air, earth, fire and water, and 20th level Mind Mage', 20, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '20 feet (6 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":23,"ME":28,"MA":27,"PS":38,"PP":22,"PE":28,"PB":27,"Spd":88}', 16500, 17000, 14000, 6000, 2000, 14, 17, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":4}', '+3 on all other saving throws, impervious to horror factor, 83% to charm/impress; alt attacks 2 by magic; opponents need 15+ to save vs his magic', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, astronomy, navigation, intelligence, cook, horsemanship: knight, all wilderness skills 98%', '2-mile hawk vision, nightvision, sees invisible, turns invisible, all languages, shapeshifts, flies 90mph, elemental immunity, teleports, fast bio-regeneration.', 'All Warlock spells (air, earth, fire, water); All 1st-7th level Wizard spells', 'Physical and sensitive psionics; Electrokinesis; Pyrokinesis; Psi-sword; Psi-shield; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'Scepter of the Greyhound (sentient greatest rune weapon); Gold plate armor (A.R. 19, S.D.C. 1000)', NULL, 'Rigid, humorless absolutist who sees only good and evil; punishes wrongdoers without compromise or friendship.', 'Isis; Gods of Light; Ramen; Uraeus (pet cobra)', 'Set; Apepi; Anubis; Demon Lords; Deevil Lords', 'Ancient hawk-headed sun god of the Ma''ip pantheon, primal deity of light and life, eternal rival of Set.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.138-140');
  'thoth', 'Thoth', 'Xy (possibly)', 'Lord of Wisdom', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '30th level Diabolist and 20th level Rune Master; also 20th level Wizard, 15th level Summoner, and 20th level Alchemist', 30, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '20 feet (6 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":38,"ME":23,"MA":27,"PS":39,"PP":22,"PE":27,"PB":25,"Spd":88}', NULL, 6200, NULL, 6000, 2000, 12, 16, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":4,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', 'Impervious to horror factor, +3 other saves, 75% charm/impress; alt attacks 3 magical; opponents need 17+ to save vs his magic. Hit points printed as 8,470 (believed) but actually 40,000; Rifts M.D.C. printed as 14,470 (really 40,000).', NULL, 'All Communications/Medical/Science/magic-related skills 98%; all other skills 82%', 'Astral travel, keen senses, nightvision, invisibility, all languages, shapeshifts freely, senses magic/ley lines, speed-reads any text, fast bio-regeneration.', 'All known magical abilities/spells except elemental magic and Necromancy; Techno-Wizardry', 'All sensitive, healing, physical psionics; Telemechanics; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'The Rod of Thoth (sentient greatest rune staff)', NULL, 'Absent-minded, secretive scholar obsessed with knowledge for its own sake; hoards forgotten magic.', 'Ra; Isis; Anhur; Raksasha; Ramen', 'Amon the Hidden One', 'Ibis-headed god of wisdom and magic, secretly a reformed Old One (Xy) reborn with reversed alignment and erased memory.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.143-145');
  'isis', 'Isis', 'Isis Sebhest', 'The All Mother & Warrior Goddess', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '20th level Wizard and 13th level Diabolist', 20, 'Principled good', NULL, '20 feet (6 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":24,"ME":25,"MA":27,"PS":37,"PP":27,"PE":27,"PB":27,"Spd":77}', 11800, 9200, 17000, 8000, 3000, 12, 17, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":5,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":10}', '+10 save vs horror factor, +2 other saves, 92% evoke trust/intimidation, 83% charm/impress; flying speed 220 (150mph); armor adds 3,000 M.D.C. on Rifts Earth', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, astronomy, navigation, land nav, wilderness survival, intelligence, holistic medicine, identify plants/fruits, preserve food, cook, horsemanship: knight, military and W.P. skills 98%', 'Astral travel, 2-mile hawk vision, nightvision, sees invisible, all languages, shapeshifts, flight, elemental resistance, summons Spirits of Light, fast bio-regeneration.', 'All Wizard spells including Legendary (20th level); All Diabolist powers (runes, symbols, wards, circles)', 'All healing and sensitive psionics; Psi-sword; Psi-shield; P.P.E. shield; Group mind block; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'The Eternal Torch (greatest rune weapon); Magic Long Bow and Moon Beam Arrows; The Sword of Isis Retributor (greatest rune sword); Crimson and gold plate armor (A.R. 18, S.D.C. 3000)', NULL, 'Compassionate, honorable warrior-mother outraged by injustice; champions mortals against Set''s corruption.', 'Ra; Gods of Light; Horus', 'Set; Anubis; Apepi; Jinn; Vampires', 'Egyptian all-mother goddess of nature, love, death and rebirth; warrior deity and eternal foe of Set for slaying Osiris.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.144-146');
  'horus', 'Horus', 'Harmakhis Heru-Ur-Sebhest', 'The Great Sphinx', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '12th level fire Warlock and 7th level Diabolist', 12, 'Scrupulous good', NULL, '19 feet (5.85 m) tall and 40 feet long (12 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":21,"ME":28,"MA":26,"PS":40,"PP":26,"PE":27,"PB":25,"Spd":88}', 2600, 4000, 6600, 2500, NULL, 12, 16, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":5,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":5,"pull":6}', '+1 save vs psionic attack, +8 save vs horror factor, +2 other saves, 75% charm/impress; dodge bonus applies when flying; opponents need 14+ to save vs his fire magic', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, astronomy, navigation, land nav, fishing, herbology, cook, pilot sail/row boats, horsemanship: knight, speaks/reads Dragonese/Elf, Gobblely, Faerie Speak, all Military/Wilderness skills 98%', 'Sphinx form (lion body, eagle wings, human face); 2-mile hawk vision, nightvision, tracking/climbing/balance skills, leaps 100ft, flight, fire resistance, human shapeshift, fast bio-regen.', 'All 1st-8th level fire elemental spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Spear of Horus (rune spear)', NULL, 'Gentle, compassionate protector of mortals, but egotistical toward those he sees as lesser beings.', 'Isis; Ra; Great White Sphinx (Thoth''s servant)', 'Set; Anubis; Apepi', 'Giant winged sphinx god of horizon and sunrise; beloved adopted son of Isis and Osiris, sworn to avenge Osiris.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.146-148');
  'bennu', 'Bennu', 'Bennu Helio', 'The Phoenix', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '20th level Mind Mage and 10th level Diabolist', 20, 'Unprincipled (selfish/good)', NULL, '20 feet (6 m) tall as a bird or humanoid', NULL, '{"IQ":17,"ME":20,"MA":20,"PS":30,"PP":26,"PE":30,"PB":28,"Spd":44}', 8700, 5300, 14000, 1800, 3000, 10, 16, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":4}', '+8 to save vs horror factor, +2 other saves; flying speed 132 (90mph); naturally regenerates 100 hp/S.D.C. per hour; drugs/poisons half effect and duration; opponents need 14+ to save vs her magic', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, astronomy, navigation, singing, all Espionage and Wilderness skills 98%', '3-mile hawk vision, nightvision, sees invisible, fire immunity, all languages, breathes without air, teleports, shapeshifts, flight, self-resurrects within 2D4 days of death.', 'All Diabolist symbols, wards, circles (10th level)', 'All sensitive and physical psionics; Bio-manipulation; Empathic transmission; Hypnotic suggestion; Mind bolt; Mind bond; Super telekinesis; Psi-sword; P.P.E. shield; Group mind block; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Self-preserving, savage hunter who avoids personal risk, yet ultimately feels obligated to help when truly needed.', 'Phoenixi; Isis; Gods of Light', 'Set; Anubis', 'Predatory bird goddess of death, rebirth, and passing seasons; effectively unkillable, self-resurrecting; adoptive mother of the Phoenixi.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.148-149');
  'apis', 'Apis', NULL, 'The Sacred Cow', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '15th level earth Warlock and 13th level Psi-Healer', 15, 'Scrupulous good', NULL, '18 feet (5.5 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":15,"ME":25,"MA":20,"PS":36,"PP":21,"PE":25,"PB":18,"Spd":77}', 4700, 6400, 9000, 1600, 1700, 11, 15, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":3}', '+5 save vs horror factor, +2 other saves, 80% evoke trust/intimidation, 65% charm/impress; opponents need 15+ to save vs her magic; alt attacks 2 by magic', NULL, 'Basic math, astronomy, land nav, herbology, cook, swim, pilot sail/row boats, horsemanship: knight, all Medical and Wilderness skills 98%', 'Astral travel, keen vision, nightvision, sees invisible, all languages, teleports, shapeshifts hoofed animal/humanoid, fast bio-regeneration, makes magic herbs/potions.', 'All earth elemental spells; 1st-3rd level air and water elemental spells', 'All Psionic Healing and Sensitive abilities; Group mind block; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Motherly, compassionate healer more devoted to helping mortals than to avenging wrongs or politics.', 'Pantheon of Ra', 'Set; Anubis; Apepi; Jinn', 'Cow-headed goddess of restoration, growth and fertility; patroness of druids and healers, empathic and devoted to mortals.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.150-151');
  'set', 'Set', 'Set Typhon-Tanis', 'Lord of Darkness', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '25th level Wizard, 18th level Summoner, 12th level Warlock (fire and air), and 10th level Mind Mage', 25, 'Diabolic evil', NULL, '25 feet (7.6 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":23,"ME":29,"MA":25,"PS":37,"PP":30,"PE":31,"PB":24,"Spd":27}', 10150, 8850, 16850, 6900, 2950, 12, 17, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":1,"dodge":1}', 'Triple damage from behind (back stab); +6 save vs psionic attack; impervious to possession/mind control/horror factor; +2 other saves; alt attacks 4 magic; opponents need 18+ to save vs his magic', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, navigation, intelligence, surveillance, interrogation, escape artist, disguise, all lores, horsemanship: knight, all at 98%; all Rogue skills 75%', 'Astral travel, nightvision, sees/turns invisible, all languages, teleports, shapeshifts (animal/humanoid/supernatural), elemental immunity, summons demons, fast bio-regeneration.', 'All Wizard spells including Spells of Legend; All fire and air elemental spells; All symbols, wards, curses, circles of protection/summoning; Power circles: domination, command, force, pain, teleport', 'All physical and sensitive psionics; Pyrokinesis; Psi-sword; P.P.E. shield; Mind block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'The Black Rod of the Four Winds (greatest rune weapon); The Impaler (great rune sword); Black and silver chain and plate armor (A.R. 19, S.D.C. 3000)', NULL, 'Manipulative, treacherous god of evil who provokes mortals into atrocities, then condemns them for it.', 'Anubis; Bes; Apepi; Andras; Vald-Tegor; Pharaoh Rama-Set; Gargoyle Empire; Jinn', 'All Gods of Light', 'Ultimate Egyptian god of darkness and betrayal; murdered and dismembered his brother Osiris, sworn enemy of the Gods of Light.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.151-153');
  'anubis', 'Anubis', 'Anupi', 'Lord of the Dead', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '20th level Summoner, 15th level Necromancer and 8th level Diabolist', 20, 'Aberrant evil', NULL, '20 feet (6 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":20,"ME":24,"MA":22,"PS":40,"PP":22,"PE":25,"PB":10,"Spd":44}', 8900, 7300, NULL, 3800, 1450, 12, 17, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":5,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":5,"roll":3}', 'Alt: 3 magic attacks/melee (vs 7 physical/psionic); +8 save vs magic, impervious to horror factor & possession/mind control, +2 all other saves, triple dmg from behind. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 17,450.', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, sign language, public speaking, holistic medicine, brewing, alchemy knowledge, hide prep, preserve food, cook, dance, intelligence, land navigation, wilderness survival, swim, horsemanship:knight, and all Rogue skills, all at 98%; Priest/Healing: Exorcism 95%, Turn dead 98% (4D6x100 dead), Animate/control 2D6x100 dead 97%, Healing touch 3D6 unlimited.', 'Nightvision 200ft, invisibility/see invisible, all languages, teleport 96%/dim.86%, shapeshift, summons 3D4 Alu demons, bio-regens 3D6x10/min, regrows limbs overnight. Deific: Pall of the Dead, Parcel of Mystery.', 'All Necromancy spells and abilities; All Wizard spells; All Spells of Legend; All powers of the Diabolist', 'All Physical Psionic abilities; Telepathy; Object Read; Presence Sense; Hydrokinesis; Mind Bolt; Psi-Shield; Psi-Swords; Mind Block auto-defense', NULL, NULL, 'Sword of Anubis (greatest rune sword, I.Q.14, diabolic, telepathic; 2D4x10 dmg to mortals, 2D4x100 to supernatural/gods; 1D4x100 to good-aligned who touch it); Armor: blue chain and plate, A.R.18, S.D.C. 2,000', NULL, 'Cold, calculating, and ruthless; underestimates mortals out of arrogance; loyal to Set, methodical in judging the dead.', 'Set; Bes; Vald-Tegor; Charun', 'Only the dead, whom he regards as his proper foes', 'Jackal-headed Egyptian death god ruling Cynopolis''s underworld; son of Osiris and Nephthys, betrayed his father to Set, now serves as Set''s calculating right hand.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.154-156');
  'apepi', 'Apepi', 'Apepi Apophis', 'The Immortal; The Dragon God of Taut', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Dragon Deity', '13th level Wizard and 8th level Warlock', 13, 'Diabolic evil', NULL, '30 feet (9 meters) long, 12 feet (3.6 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":11,"ME":14,"MA":19,"PS":58,"PP":29,"PE":24,"PB":5,"Spd":44}', 6500, 5000, NULL, 1200, 480, 17, 17, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":6,"strike":8,"parry":10,"dodge":10}', '+3 save vs psionic attack, +6 save vs magic, +6 save vs poison/drugs; vulnerable to holy/silver/some rune weapons for triple damage. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 10,000.', NULL, 'Palming, pick lock and streetwise, all at 70%; Priest/Healing: Exorcism 18%, Turn dead 57% (1D6x10 dead).', 'Nightvision 200ft, invisibility, all languages, teleport 89%/dim.31%, flight, all powers of an elder dragon, bio-regen 2D4x100/min, regrows limbs in 1D4x10 min. Deific: innate resurrection/immortality.', 'All air and water elemental spells; 1st through 6th level Wizard spells', 'All Physical Psionic abilities; Empathy; Telepathy; Presence Sense; Sixth Sense; Electrokinesis; Hydrokinesis; Telekinesis (super); Mind Bolt', NULL, NULL, 'None (relies on brute strength, magic, psionics, and supernatural abilities)', NULL, 'Vicious, reckless, and vindictive; craves pain and violence; fiercely loyal only to Set, remembers every past death and its cause.', 'Set; Bes; Thoth; Pharaoh Rama-Set', 'Ra; Gods of Light', 'Immortal winged serpent, an unprecedented dragon species, granted eternal life by Set in exchange for lifelong servitude; sadistic and self-destructive.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.156-157');
  'amon', 'Amon', 'Ammon-Ra', 'The Hidden One', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '17th level Warlock (fire) and 15th level Diabolist', 17, 'Aberrant evil', NULL, '19 feet (5.9 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":19,"ME":11,"MA":20,"PS":30,"PP":23,"PE":25,"PB":2,"Spd":44}', 7400, 7500, NULL, 1900, 1250, 8, 19, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', 'Alt: 2 magic attacks/melee; +6 save vs horror factor, +2 all other saves, triple dmg from behind (back stabbing). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 11,473.', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, cook, dance, sing, play flute, intelligence, navigation, wilderness survival, swim, horsemanship:knight, all at 98%; plus disguise, escape, pick locks, locate secret compartments, interrogation, use poison, all Medical skills at 78%; Priest/Healing: Exorcism 86%, Turn dead 92% (1D4x100 dead), Animate/control 4D4 dead 92%, Healing touch 3D6 unlimited, Resurrection 44%.', 'Flight, nightvision 200ft, invisibility, all languages, teleport 91%/dim.47%, summons 1D6x100 rodents, bio-regens 1D4x100/min, regrows limbs overnight. Deific: vomits destructive flame (Deific Self-Loathing).', 'All fire elemental spells; 1st through 5th level air and earth elemental spells; Runes, wards and circles', 'All Psychic Sensitive abilities; Bio-Manipulation; Empathic Transmission; Hypnotic Suggestion; Pyrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'Blood Fellow (indestructible dark red lesser rune dagger, I.Q.16, diabolic, telepathic; 1D6-5D6 dmg to mortals, 1D6x10-5D6x10 to supernatural/magical beings); The Enslaver (magic device shaped like an insect statue; casts trance/compulsion/dominance/fear/mask of deceit 3x/24hrs; 220 I.S.P. worth of psionics)', NULL, 'Bitter, cruel, and vengeful; delights in disfiguring attractive beings; mostly a loner pursuing her own agenda.', 'Anhur; Mantus; Tark', 'Set; Anubis', 'Once beautiful light goddess, disfigured and driven insane after betraying Osiris; now a hag-like god of ugliness, vengeance, and cruelty.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.157-159');
  'anhur', 'Anhur', 'Anher Thinis', 'The Slayer of Enemies', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '15th level knight, 9th level Diabolist, and 4th level Long Bowman', 15, 'Aberrant evil', NULL, '18 feet (5.5 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":22,"ME":24,"MA":24,"PS":51,"PP":28,"PE":30,"PB":20,"Spd":88}', 5470, 6200, NULL, 1250, NULL, 13, 16, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":7,"strike":2,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":9}', 'Alt: 2 magic attacks/melee; strike bonus is +2 hand to hand but +4 with any bow weapon; +10 save vs horror factor, +2 other saves, 80% intimidation/trust, 50% charm/impress. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 10,000.', NULL, 'All Weapon Proficiencies and all Military skills at 98%, plus track humanoids, escape artist, climb, swim, juggling, dance, intelligence, all wilderness skills at 87%; Priest/Healing: Exorcism 61%, Turn dead 69% (3D6x10 dead), Remove curse 64%, Remove deific curse 34%, Resurrection 33%, Healing touch unlimited.', 'Nightvision 200ft, invisibility, all languages, teleport 94%/dim.53%, flight 75mph, never fatigues/sleeps, bio-regens 5D6x10/min, regrows limbs overnight. Full deific powers at regular cost.', 'Wizard spells: dispel magic barrier, negate magic, metamorphosis:human, speed of the snail, circles of protection, wards, mystic portal, anti-magic cloud, close Rift, dimensional portal, teleport:superior; Diabolist: magic symbols, reading runes, basic wards, half of power circles, all protection circles', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The Scepter of Bedevilment (indestructible Greatest Rune Weapon, I.Q.9, aberrant, telepathic; 2D4x10 dmg, can hover/fly/attack on its own with 3 attacks/melee); Golden plate armor, A.R.17, S.D.C. 3,000', NULL, 'Honorable, courteous to worthy warriors, contemptuous of cowards; enjoys physical contests; acts independently despite serving Set.', 'Styphon; Zandragal; Joker of Palladium', 'Four Horsemen; non-Nile Gods of Light and Darkness', 'Lion-headed warrior god serving as Set''s military commander and assassin; unusually honorable for a dark god, respected even by the Gods of Light.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.159-160');
  'ammit', 'Ammit', 'Ammiti-nupi', 'The Beast', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '10th level Merc. and 4th level Necromancer', 10, 'Miscreant evil', NULL, '28 feet (8.5 meters) long, 10 feet (3 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":12,"ME":24,"MA":7,"PS":40,"PP":22,"PE":26,"PB":3,"Spd":66}', 3500, 3000, NULL, 1100, 750, 15, 16, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":5,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4}', 'Alt: 2 magic attacks/melee; +1 save vs magic, impervious to horror factor, triple dmg from behind (back stabbing). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 5,000 (Rifts Earth unknown to Ammit).', NULL, 'Basic math, biology, climb, swim, fish, hunt, track humanoids/animals, skin & prepare animal hides, preserve food, cook, dance, detect ambush, detect concealment, intelligence, land navigation, wilderness survival, all at 88%; Priest/Healing: None.', 'Nightvision 1000ft, invisibility, all languages, teleport 91%/dim.78%, shapeshift, resistant to heat/cold/fire, bio-regens 3D6x10/min, regrows limbs overnight. Full deific powers at double cost.', 'All Necromancy spells and abilities (equal to a 4th level spell caster)', 'All Physical Psionic abilities; Telepathy; Electrokinesis', NULL, NULL, 'None (relies on magic, psionics, and supernatural abilities)', NULL, 'Loyal and subservient to Anubis; a cunning schemer; cocky, often underestimates mortals'' cleverness and violence.', 'Anubis; Abdul-Ra', NULL, 'Crocodile-lion-hippo hybrid monster serving Anubis, devouring souls of the dead; secretly scheming with a demon lord over an imprisoned deevil noblewoman.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.160-161');
  'bes', 'Bes', 'Bes-shuvin', 'The Depraved', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '12th level Warlock (earth) and 9th level Psy-Mystic', 12, 'Diabolic evil', NULL, '5 feet (1.5 meters) tall in colossal realms, ~3 feet in epic realms, under 2 feet in heroic realms or on the Palladium World', NULL, '{"IQ":17,"ME":24,"MA":24,"PS":41,"PP":24,"PE":27,"PB":6,"Spd":33}', 3900, 3700, NULL, 1800, 950, 11, 16, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":6,"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":5}', 'Alt: 2 magic attacks/melee; +2 save vs magic, +9 save vs horror factor, 80% intimidation/trust. Insanities: psychotic/sadistic murder, cannibalism & danger obsessions, phobia of Osiris. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 6,000.', NULL, 'Basic/advanced math, navigation, pick locks, pick pockets, dance, play guitar/flute, horsemanship:knight, all at 91%; Priest/Healing: Exorcism 40%, Turn dead 69% (3D6x10 dead), Remove curse 44%, Remove deific curse 20%, Resurrection 32%, Healing touch unlimited.', 'Nightvision 200ft, invisibility, all languages, teleport 93%/dim.77%, never fatigues, shapeshift (toad/snake/rat/humanoid), bio-regens 2D6x100/min, regrows limbs overnight.', 'All earth elemental spells; Wizard spells: blinding flash, globe of daylight, befuddle, fear, carpet of adhesion, magic net, domination, energy disruption, call lightning, mask of deceit, agony, life drain, negate magic, luck curse, mute, summon & control canines, chameleon, mystic alarm, fuel flame', 'All Physical Psionic abilities; Mentally Possess Others; Mind Bond; Mind Wipe', NULL, NULL, 'Mee (indestructible silver greatest rune dagger, I.Q.10, sadistic, hates women/children); Fea (indestructible silver greatest rune dagger, I.Q.13, paranoid schizophrenic, pyromaniac; can cast spontaneous combustion/circle of flame/wall of flame/fire ball every 2 melees); both animated with bat wings, return when thrown, 3 attacks/melee on their own', NULL, 'Demented, sadistic, and obsessed with cannibalism and danger; phobic of Osiris; enamored with torture-capable technology.', 'Set; Amon; Kubera-Loe', NULL, 'Once a light god, now a depraved dwarf deity of murder and cannibalism after a mental breakdown; recruited into the dark pantheon by Set.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.161-162');
  'sebek', 'Sebek', 'Sebek Arimi', NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity', '15th level Thief and 10th level Wizard', 15, 'Anarchist with leanings toward evil', NULL, '18 feet (5.5 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":20,"ME":19,"MA":19,"PS":40,"PP":18,"PE":28,"PB":10,"Spd":33}', 3400, 3070, NULL, 930, 220, 14, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":5}', 'Alt: 2 magic attacks/melee; +8 save vs horror factor, +3 all other saves. Speed 33 (22.5mph/36km, double while swimming). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 6,470.', NULL, 'Escape, forgery, land navigation, navigation, astronomy, operate boats/ships, and all Rogue skills, all at 98%; Priest/Healing: Exorcism 50%, Turn dead 50% (1D6x10 dead), Remove magic curse 34%, Resurrection 10%, Healing touch unlimited.', 'Nightvision 200ft, invisibility, all languages, shapeshift (crocodile/crocodillian), teleport 94%/dim.83%, swim 98%, never fatigues, summons 1D4x100 crocodiles, bio-regens 1D4x100/min, regrows limb within a week.', '1st through 6th level Wizard spells', 'Telepathy; Mind Block; Hypnotic Suggestion (super); Mind Wipe (super); Mentally Possess Others (super)', NULL, NULL, 'The Scepter of the Serpent (indestructible greatest rune weapon, I.Q.14, anarchist, telepathic; 1D6x10 dmg as a club, twin crocodile heads breathe magic fire for 1D6x10 dmg at 1,000ft range)', NULL, 'Unpredictable troublemaker; cunning yet petty and childish; allies only for personal gain, abandons causes when bored.', 'Lista', 'The Gods of Darkness, especially the pantheon of Taut; the Gods of Light avoid him', 'Crocodile-headed god of chaos and mischief, loyal to no side, allying with whichever faction benefits him; fallen from grace with both pantheons.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.163-164');
  'od', 'Od', 'Od''Eanwll Brggson', 'The All Father', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods)', '25th level Wizard and 23rd level mercenary warrior', 25, 'Scrupulous (good)', NULL, '22 feet (7 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":32,"ME":37,"MA":29,"PS":31,"PP":26,"PE":31,"PB":15,"Spd":27}', 23805, 18600, NULL, 2750, 310, 11, 16, '{"initiative":4,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":4}', 'Attacks/melee: 10 physical/psionic or 7 magic. +10 save vs horror factor, +2 all other saves, 93% charm/impress. AR 17 in armor (SDC 9,000). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 42,000.', NULL, 'Basic math, dance, disguise, forgery, impersonate voices & impersonation, ventriloquism, brewing, lore: dragons/demons/monsters (no % given); all Communications, Military, Wilderness skills 98%; all Rogue skills 60%.', 'Astral travel, nightvision, invisibility, immune to cold/heat/fire, fast bio-regeneration, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines and magic, shapechanges into animal, humanoid, or any specific dragon (near-perfect impersonation).', 'Wizard spells including all Spells of Legend', 'Mind block; See aura; Sense magic; Spontaneous combustion; Teleport object; Object read; Sense dimensional anomaly; Telemechanics; All healing psionics', NULL, NULL, 'Ghundeg (rune claymore, 2D6x10 dmg, 4D6x100 vs dragons, fires fireball 1D6x10 or ice ball 1D4x10); Black Plate Armor ''Xatemass'' (AR 19, SDC 9,000, impervious to dragon breath)', NULL, 'Cunning, secretive binder of dragons; a devoted but philandering, chauvinistic husband and father.', 'Vallisque-Tan', 'Dragons (all kinds)', 'Northern pantheon''s patriarch god of wisdom and strength, famed for trapping and binding powerful dragons through trickery.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.165-167');
  'epim', 'Epim', 'Epim Ymrrsdotter', 'The All Mother', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods)', '23rd level Rune Mage, 14th level Diabolist and 10th level Wizard', 23, 'Principled', NULL, '18 feet (6 meters)', NULL, '{"IQ":21,"ME":26,"MA":25,"PS":37,"PP":20,"PE":30,"PB":31,"Spd":22}', 7800, 6900, NULL, 3300, NULL, 11, 12, '{"initiative":2,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":3}', 'Attacks/melee: 6 physical or 4 magic. +6 save vs horror factor, +4 all other saves, 99% charm/impress. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 17,500.', '[{"name":"Horsemanship: Knight","pct":98},{"name":"Card Shark","pct":98}]', 'All Domestic, Medical, Wilderness skills 98%.', 'Astral travel, nightvision, invisibility, cold resistance, fast bio-regeneration, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines/magic, shapechanges into animal or humanoid.', 'All Diabolist magic (incl. wards); 1st-9th level Wizard spells; secret rune magic (undisclosed)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Devoted but self-effacing mother and wife who quietly wields immense hidden power.', 'Her children (Locknar, Hoknar, Hel)', 'The Na''runs', 'Wife of Od and All-Mother of the Northern pantheon, a nature and rune-magic goddess who hides her true power.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.168-169');
  'locknar', 'Locknar', 'Locknar Odsson', 'God of Mischief and Deceit', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods)', '17th level Mind Mage, 13th level Warlock (air and fire), 10th level Diabolist, and 7th level Prestidigitator', 17, 'Anarchist (selfish)', NULL, '20 ft (6 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":39,"ME":34,"MA":33,"PS":28,"PP":29,"PE":26,"PB":30,"Spd":27}', 16300, 8200, NULL, 7400, 2100, 10, 13, '{"initiative":3,"strike":4,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":6}', 'Attacks/melee: 5 physical/psionic or 3 magic. +7 save vs horror factor, +3 all other saves, 93% charm/impress. AR 15 in armor (SDC 2,200). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 24,000.', '[{"name":"Jesting","pct":96},{"name":"Juggling","pct":96},{"name":"Forgery","pct":96},{"name":"Locate Secret Compartments/Doors","pct":96},{"name":"Brewing","pct":96},{"name":"Rope Works","pct":96},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":96},{"name":"Surveillance","pct":96},{"name":"Palming","pct":96},{"name":"Pick Pockets","pct":96}]', 'All Communication skills 96%.', 'Astral travel, nightvision, invisibility, fast bio-regeneration, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines/magic/elementals, shapechanges into animal, humanoid, or supernatural form.', 'All air and fire elemental spells; 1st-5th level Wizard spells; Animate object; Swim as fish: superior; Words of truth; Agony; Dispel magic barriers; Invisibility: superior; Second sight; Commune with sphinx; Mute; Control & enslave entity; Anti-magic cloud; All power words, runes, symbols, wards', 'Meditation; See aura; Sixth sense; Sense dimensional anomaly; Total recall; Empathic transmission; Hypnotic suggestion; Insert memory; Mind bond; Psi-sword; Telemechanics; All physical and healing psionics', NULL, NULL, 'Ruruga (rune dagger, 1D4x10 dmg, returns when thrown); Tasber (rune dagger, strikes as lightning bolt when thrown, 1D6x10 dmg); Itemba (rune dagger, 3D6 dmg, double vs undead/deevils/demons/gods); Lockni (rune dagger, 2D6 dmg, detects enchantment/magic, wards charm/mesmerism); Crimson chain and scale mail armor (AR 14, SDC 2,000, magic, lightweight, noiseless)', NULL, 'Clever trickster grown somber after his daughter Hel''s tragic curse; still capable of good or ill.', NULL, NULL, 'Eldest son of Od and Epim, Northern god of mischief and deceit, devastated by his daughter Hel''s fate.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.169-170');
  'hoknar', 'Hoknar', 'Hoknar Odsson', 'God of Thunder and Lightning', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods)', '20th level Palladin and 8th level Warlock (air)', 20, 'Scrupulous', NULL, '20 ft (6 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":18,"ME":22,"MA":24,"PS":32,"PP":30,"PE":30,"PB":30,"Spd":33}', 14300, 9400, NULL, 1300, NULL, 11, 11, '{"initiative":5,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":5}', 'Attacks/melee: 10 physical, or 5 physical + 5 lightning, or 1 magic + 2 physical. Can Call Lightning (as 8th-level Warlock) free, up to 5x/melee. +11 save vs horror factor, +1 all other saves, 78% charm/impress. AR 17 in armor (SDC 3,000). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 26,000.', NULL, 'All Military and Wilderness skills 94%.', 'Nightvision, invisibility, immune to fire/cold, fast bio-regeneration, never fatigues, knows all languages, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines/elementals, shapechanges into animal (esp. bear), humanoid, or supernatural form.', 'All air elemental spells, levels 1-8', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Axe of Glory (rune battle axe, 6D6 dmg or 1D6x10 as thrown lightning bolt, returns to thrower); Shield of Power (indestructible silver shield, reflects non-magic energy, SDC 1,300, regens 2D6x10/melee); Gold splint armor (AR 15, SDC 3,000)', NULL, 'Earnest, honorable warrior who unknowingly bears a name given ''wrongly,'' leading to hollow, costly victories.', NULL, 'Gods of darkness, especially Deevils', 'Second son of Od and Epim, Northern god of war and thunder, cursed by a naming error at birth.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.170-172');
  'heim', 'Heim', 'Heim''nara Ygllgssdotter', 'Goddess of the Hunt', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods)', '13th level Ranger, 11th level Long Bowman and 10th level Warlock (earth)', 13, 'Unprincipled (selfish)', NULL, '58 feet (17.6 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":21,"ME":26,"MA":22,"PS":36,"PP":30,"PE":28,"PB":22,"Spd":33}', 9330, 8500, NULL, 1250, NULL, 12, 14, '{"initiative":6,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":5,"pull":8}', 'Attacks/melee: 9 physical or 2 magic. +9 save vs horror factor, +1 all other saves, 90% charm/impress. AR 14 with armor (SDC 2,500). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 18,000.', '[{"name":"Track Humanoids","pct":98}]', 'All Wilderness and Military skills 98%.', 'Sharp long-range vision, nightvision, invisibility, fire/cold resistance, fast bio-regeneration, never fatigues, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines, shapechanges into animal (oversized cougar) or humanoid.', 'All earth elemental spells; Color water; Create fog; Sense direction underwater; Walk the waves; Change current; Fog of fear; Circle of rain; Impervious to ocean depths; Communicate with sea creatures', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Giant short bow (supernatural PS damage, 2D4x10); Thunder Mace (6D6x100 dmg, deafens in 15ft radius); Gold and Green magic armor (AR 14, SDC 2,500)', NULL, 'Solitary, forlorn huntress, crushed by an awkward, failed romance with Hoknar.', 'Epim (loyal to her); Belimar (visits him for company)', NULL, 'Goddess of the hunt and forest, close to Epim, who lives alone and pines quietly for Hoknar.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.173-174');
  'belimar', 'Belimar', 'Belimar Trnksson', 'The Dwarf', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods, Dwarf)', '20th level Rune Smith and 15th level Diabolist', 20, 'Anarchist (was unprincipled)', NULL, '8 feet (2.4 m) tall in colossal form', NULL, '{"IQ":41,"ME":36,"MA":20,"PS":35,"PP":27,"PE":35,"PB":19,"Spd":22}', 3900, 4750, NULL, 5500, NULL, 10, 14, '{"strike":3,"parry":4,"dodge":6,"pull":4}', 'Attacks/melee: 5 physical or 3 magic. +10 save vs horror factor, 79% charm/impress. AR 18 by armor (SDC 5,000). Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 8,500.', NULL, 'All Science and Medical skills 98% each.', 'Astral travel, nightvision, see aura, sees infrared/UV via rune eye, invisibility, fire/cold resistance, fast bio-regeneration, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines/magic, shapechanges into animal or humanoid.', 'Runes and rune magic; All Wizard spells; All Diabolist abilities; All fire elemental spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dozens of rune weapons (unspecified); Bronze plate and chain armor inscribed with runes (AR 18, SDC 500, impervious to fire/cold)', NULL, 'Brilliant but socially oblivious rune-smith, loyal to Epim, secretly smitten with Heim.', 'Od; Epim', 'Locknar', 'Dwarf god and master rune-smith of the Northern pantheon, creator of magic weapons and armor.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.174-175');
  'wolvenar', 'Wolvenar', 'Ianate Wolvenar Kol', NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Northern Gods, Wolfen)', '12th level Soldier and 2nd level Wizard', 12, 'Principled (good)', NULL, '42 feet (13 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":23,"ME":21,"MA":25,"PS":47,"PP":27,"PE":40,"PB":24,"Spd":44}', 7500, 8000, NULL, 1600, NULL, 13, 16, '{"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":5}', 'Attacks/melee: 8 physical/psionic or 1 magic (still growing; expected +2 physical & +1 magic within 1,000 years). +5 save vs horror factor, 90% charm/impress. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 15,000.', '[{"name":"Horsemanship: Knight","pct":60},{"name":"Climb","pct":60},{"name":"Swim","pct":60},{"name":"Dance","pct":60},{"name":"Sing","pct":60},{"name":"Fish","pct":60},{"name":"Art","pct":60},{"name":"Breed Dogs","pct":60},{"name":"Lore: Demons and Monsters","pct":60}]', 'All Military and Wilderness skills 83%.', 'Nightvision, tracks by smell/scent, invisibility, keen hearing, fire/cold resistance, fast bio-regeneration, never fatigues, teleport/dim. teleport, senses ley lines, shapechanges into animal or humanoid, great leaping.', 'All 1st level spells; Chameleon; Float in air; Sense traps; Repel animals; Tongues; Fly as the eagle', 'Telekinetic punch; Telekinetic leap; Alter aura; All psionic sensitive abilities', NULL, NULL, 'Magical partial plate armor (AR 14, SDC 480)', NULL, 'Young, idealistic, courageous god still discovering his identity and place among the Northern pantheon.', 'Heim', 'Frssvrr the Troll; Deevils', 'A newly-arisen Wolfen god, likely born from the rise of the Wolfen Empire; eager but untested.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.175-177');
  'ippotomi', 'Ippotomi', 'Ipposo Mii Avlw', 'Water Goddess', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Southern/Jungle Gods)', '15th level air and water Warlock, and healer', 15, 'Unprincipled', NULL, '20 feet (6 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":22,"ME":30,"MA":23,"PS":50,"PP":21,"PE":24,"PB":15,"Spd":14}', 8400, 9000, NULL, 2500, 210, 14, 15, '{"initiative":6,"strike":2,"parry":1,"dodge":1,"pull":5}', 'Attacks/melee: 6 physical/psionic or 2 magic. +12 save vs horror factor. Opponents need 16+ to save vs her magic. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 11,500; magic and mega-damage weapons do full damage.', '[{"name":"Basic Math","pct":98},{"name":"Astronomy & Navigation","pct":98}]', 'All Naval/Sailor and Wilderness skills 98%; all Medical skills 60%.', 'Astral travel, breathes underwater indefinitely, impervious to cold/pressure/poison, swims 98%, nightvision, invisibility, fast bio-regeneration, teleport/dim. teleport, senses water/ley lines/magic/elementals, limited shapechange (hippo or human maiden), summons elementals.', 'All air and water elemental spells', 'Hydrokinesis; Electrokinesis; Empathic transmission; Invisible haze; All healing and sensitive psionics', NULL, NULL, 'Armlets of Ippotomi (protective enchanted jewelry, lent to favored sailors); Headdress of Ippotomi (holy artifact; +PE22, saves vs poison/disease/coma, healing touch, AR18 SDC900)', NULL, 'Calm, compassionate, patient healer who tempers her violent jungle pantheon''s excesses.', 'Lopnel and Yin-Sloth (pantheon-mates, defend her)', 'Aco and the Juggernaut; Kirgi; Tolmet; Deevils; Algor (rival over the Southern Oceans)', 'Ancient, compassionate sea goddess of the Southern pantheon who protects sailors despite her violent pantheon-mates.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.178-180');
  'lopnel', 'Lopnel', 'Trinist Bly Lopnel', 'The Red God', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Southern/Jungle Gods)', '15th level mercenary warrior and 8th level Earth Warlock', 15, 'Anarchist', NULL, '18 feet (5.5 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":22,"ME":19,"MA":19,"PS":52,"PP":26,"PE":28,"PB":10,"Spd":88}', 4750, 5420, NULL, 1150, NULL, 10, 15, '{"initiative":7,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":5,"pull":6}', 'Attacks/melee: 9 physical or 2 magic. +12 save vs horror factor, +1 all other saves, 55% to evoke intimidation/trust. AR 17 in plate armor (SDC 3,000). Deific powers cost double.', '[{"name":"Track Humanoids","pct":82},{"name":"Climb","pct":82},{"name":"Swim","pct":82},{"name":"Juggling","pct":82},{"name":"Dance","pct":82},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":82}]', 'All Weapon Proficiencies (W.P.) and all Military skills 98%; all Wilderness skills 82%.', 'Nightvision, invisibility, knows all languages, teleport/dim. teleport, never fatigues, fast bio-regeneration, regrows limbs.', 'All Earth Warlock spells, levels 1-8', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Blood Drinker (Greatest Rune axe, vampiric, 1D4x10 mortal / 3D4x10 vs supernatural / 1D4x1000 vs Alien Intelligences); Bushwacker (Great Rune dagger, 4D6 dmg, invisible on command, casts 6 spells/day); Ornate bronze plate armor (AR 17, SDC 3,000); Headdress of Lopnel (holy artifact; supernatural PS 20, +5 dmg, bio-regen, 3 spells/day)', NULL, 'Zealous, hot-headed warmonger who craves battle for its own sake and feels empty after victory.', 'Gargoyles and Gallu Bulls of Hades', 'Yin-Sloth (feared); Raksashas; Jinn', 'The Red God of the Southern pantheon, an unrelenting warmonger building his own realm of endless war.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.180-182');
  'pith', 'Pith', 'Kraa Pith', 'The Snake God', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Deity (Southern/Jungle Gods)', '20th level assassin, 10th level Air and Water Warlock', 20, 'Miscreant evil', NULL, 'Stands 10-20 feet (3-6 m) tall, 50 feet (15.2 m) long', NULL, '{"IQ":20,"ME":24,"MA":20,"PS":40,"PP":23,"PE":24,"PB":8,"Spd":22}', 6800, 5100, NULL, 2050, NULL, 13, 16, '{"initiative":5,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":6,"pull":10,"roll":3}', 'Attacks/melee: 7 physical/psionic or 3 magic; dodge counts as parry, no extra attack cost. Triple damage from behind. +2 save vs magic, impervious to horror factor, +2 all other saves. Rifts Earth M.D.C.: 17,450.', NULL, 'Basic and advanced math, sign language, public speaking, holistic medicine, brewing, alchemy (some), skin & prepare hides, preserve food, cook, dance, intelligence, land navigation, wilderness survival, swim, horsemanship: knight (no % given); all Rogue skills 98%.', 'Nightvision, invisibility, infrared vision, tracks by smell, keen taste (identifies substances/poisons), knows all languages, teleport/dim. teleport, limited shapechange (snake/vulture/human), heat/cold/fire resistant, poison immune, summons Worms of Taut, fast bio-regeneration, regrows limbs/tail.', 'All Necromancy spells and abilities; All Wizard spells; All Spells of Legend; All Diabolist powers', 'Telepathy; Object read; Presence sense; Hydrokinesis; Mind bolt; Psi-shield; Psi-sword; Mind block auto-defense; All Physical Psionic abilities', NULL, NULL, 'Headdress of Pith (holy artifact; supernatural PP20, +3 strike/parry/dodge, +20% prowl, summons snakes, AR18 SDC700); Venom Injector (poison dart device taught to assassin-priests)', NULL, 'Cold, calculating hunter-assassin who values cunning and treachery, dismissive of mercy.', 'Set; Anubis', 'Michla-Da', 'Ancient snake-bodied god of death and assassination worshipped by a cult of master assassins.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.182-185');
