  'rabdos', 'Rabdos', NULL, 'the Strangler', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '25th level Assassin', 25, 'Diabolic', NULL, '20 feet (6 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":24,"ME":22,"MA":30,"PS":28,"PP":30,"PE":27,"PB":33,"Spd":27}', 3500, 3900, NULL, 1600, NULL, 10, NULL, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":6,"strike":5,"parry":6,"dodge":6,"pull":10}', 'Horror Factor stated as None, explicitly - part of her skill is passing unnoticed; impervious to horror factor, +1 all saves, death blow on natural 18-20, 93% to charm/impress; Rifts Earth equivalent M.D.C.: 7,500', NULL, 'All Espionage, Military and Rogue/Thief skills at 98%, plus Horsemanship: General', 'Nightvision 120ft, sees the invisible, shapeshifts humanoid, teleport 90%/dimensional 66%, immune to poison, bio-regen 6D6/round; weakened by sunlight and cold (half attacks/bonuses)', 'All 1st and 2nd level Wizard spells (cast at 6th level expertise)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Genuinely pleasant and level-headed yet secretly insane, drawn to sadism and compulsive perversions', 'Tolmet', 'Andras', 'Demon Lord and personal assassin to Modeus, a passionate, well-spoken woman who is also privately quite insane', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.206-207');
