  'mictla', 'Mictla', NULL, 'the Devourer', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', NULL, NULL, 'Miscreant (evil)', NULL, '52 feet (15.8 m) tall, and 136 feet (41.4 m) long', NULL, '{"IQ":17,"ME":30,"MA":20,"PS":50,"PP":22,"PE":38,"PB":2,"Spd":18}', 7370, 9400, NULL, 1900, 230, 14, 19, '{"attacks":8}', '+5 to strike with tongue, +3 to strike with tentacles; a natural roll of 18-20 to strike (or any roll of 20+) throws the victim into her maw; tongue Spd 80 (55mph); Rifts Earth equivalent M.D.C.: 18,000', NULL, NULL, 'Nightvision 200ft, immune to fire/cold, bio-regen 2D6x10/min plus tongue regrowth within 1D6 hours, teleport 66%/dimensional 24%', NULL, 'All physical psionics; Presence sense; See aura; Sense magic; Sense evil; Advanced trance state', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Gluttonous and playful with her prey, constantly devouring living things in her underground lair', 'Modeus; Belphegor', 'Deevil Lords; forces of good', 'Demon Lord who is a sprawling, tentacled subterranean mass, devouring prey with an adhesive tongue and cavernous maw', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.207-208');
  'succor-bemoth', 'Succor-Bemoth', NULL, NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '16th level Wizard', 16, 'Diabolic', NULL, '20 feet (6 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":26,"ME":30,"MA":20,"PS":27,"PP":19,"PE":20,"PB":6,"Spd":40}', 1800, 3100, NULL, 1400, NULL, 12, 14, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":2,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3}', '+10 save vs horror factor, +3 all other saves; does double damage from behind; impervious to mind control; Rifts Earth equivalent M.D.C.: 5,000', NULL, 'All Wilderness and Science skills at 98%', 'Bio-regen 1D6x10/min plus complete limb regrowth within 48 hours, nightvision 600ft, invisible at will, immune to fire/cold, teleport 90%/dimensional 81%, shapeshifts animal/humanoid/supernatural', 'All 1st-11th level Wizard spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Bone Flail: +4 to strike, 1D6x10 (mortals), 2D6x10 (supernatural), 2D6x100 (gods)', NULL, 'Psychotically jealous of anything he covets; destroys what he cannot have, or its owner', 'Charun; Vald-Tegor', 'Those of good alignment', 'Demon Lord ruling the Magots on the third continent of Hades, first to discover that demon sacrifice could offset deific power costs', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.208-209');
  'charun', 'Charun', NULL, 'the Cruel', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '19th level Summoner and 8th level Mind Mage', 19, 'Diabolic (megalomaniac)', NULL, '16 feet', NULL, '{"IQ":22,"ME":23,"MA":26,"PS":35,"PP":32,"PE":30,"PB":5,"Spd":27}', 4100, 3850, NULL, 2290, 500, 13, 16, '{"attacks":5,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"damage":4}', '+3 all saving throws, 99% to charm/impress; ground Spd 27 (18.5mph), flying Spd 88 (60mph); Rifts Earth equivalent M.D.C.: 9,000', NULL, 'All Rogue/Thief skills at 97%', 'Nightvision 120ft, invisible at will, flies 88mph, immune to fire/cold, bio-regen, teleport 85%/dimensional 59%, shapeshifts humanoid/supernatural; vulnerable to cold/ice/water', 'All symbols, wards, and circles of protection; Circles of power: Domination/Control, Command, Pain, Power Leech', 'All Psionic Physical and Sensitive abilities; Cause insanity; Hypnotic suggestion; Induce nightmares; Insert memory; Mentally possess others; Psi-sword', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Obsessive and ambitious, building minion armies and subverting the Gargoyles to break away from Modeus', 'Mania; Anubis (Pantheon of Taut)', 'Mantus; Tolmet (also his obsession)', 'Demon Lord based on the northern continent of Hades, secretly recruiting the Alu, Lasae, and Jinn into a rebellion against Modeus', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.209-210');
  'abdul-ra', 'Abdul-Ra', NULL, NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '20th level Mind Mage and 10th level Summoner', 20, 'Aberrant (evil)', NULL, '6 feet (1.8 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":21,"ME":26,"MA":25,"PS":37,"PP":21,"PE":28,"PB":14,"Spd":27}', 3900, 3800, NULL, 1990, 850, 12, 15, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":5}', '99% to charm/impress; whether he would ever visit Rifts Earth is stated only as Unknown; Rifts Earth equivalent M.D.C.: 7,900; Minions: lord of the Raksasha; can summon 5D6 of them at any time and raise an army in a few days', '[{"name":"Dance","pct":96},{"name":"Play the Lute","pct":96},{"name":"Public Speaking","pct":96},{"name":"Gemology","pct":96}]', 'All Rogue, Science, Military and Wilderness skills at 96%', 'Nightvision 200ft, invisible at will, shapeshifts mist/animal/humanoid/supernatural, fire/cold resistant (half dmg), bio-regen 2D6x10/min, teleport 89%/dimensional 63%', 'Knowledge of symbols, all protection, summoning and power circles; All first level Wizard spells; Experimental circle of summoning for deities', 'All super psionics; All physical and sensitive abilities', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Suave and sophisticated, conflicted about his unlikely love affair with his former captor', 'Ammit the Beast (Pantheon of Taut); Rhada (romantically)', 'The Deevil Lords', 'Feline-headed Demon Lord entangled in a secret, unlikely love affair with the Deevil goddess Rhada, his former captor', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.211-212');
  'random', 'Random', NULL, 'Valet of Abdul-Ra', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Human', '10th level mercenary fighter', 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 79, 45, NULL, NULL, NULL, 17, NULL, '{"attacks":5}', 'Only I.Q. 10 is printed (no full attribute block). Armor: full plate, magic (weightless, noiseless), A.R. 17, S.D.C. 400.', NULL, NULL, 'None printed; several insanities instead (see disposition).', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Magic long sword (indestructible), 3D6+14 damage; Ring of invisibility (20 minutes, 3x daily); Full plate armor (magic: weightless, noiseless, A.R. 17, S.D.C. 400)', NULL, 'Insane, clever, and dangerous; disgusted by slime, needs domination, compulsive liar, phobic of dogs.', 'Abdul-Ra', NULL, 'A human mercenary serving as Abdul-Ra''s devoted valet and bodyguard; treated as a pet by the Raksasha.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.212');
  'belphegor', 'Belphegor', NULL, 'of the Sulfur Pits', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '6th level Fire Warlock', 6, 'Diabolic (evil)', NULL, '24 feet (7.3 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":7,"ME":12,"MA":7,"PS":48,"PP":20,"PE":26,"PB":3,"Spd":22}', 9120, 12000, 24000, 2300, 160, 13, 17, '{"attacks":8,"initiative":2,"strike":3,"parry":5,"dodge":5}', 'Alt: 2 attacks/melee if using magic. Impervious to poison; +2 on all saving throws. Deific powers cost double standard. Minions: none directly, but can summon 1D6+2 Gallu Bulls or 1D4 Magots.', '[{"name":"Land navigation","pct":92}]', NULL, 'Nightvision 200ft, see/turn invisible, impervious to fire, bio-regen 2D4x10/min, dimensional teleport 43%.', 'All fire elemental spells levels 1-2', 'All psionic sensitive abilities', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Sadistic and reclusive; delights in devouring victims; stays out of Demon Lord politics but sows chaos among mortals.', 'Mictla', 'Various forces for good', 'A Demon Lord ruling a sulfurous underground region of Hades, symbol of lust, known for tearing apart and devouring creatures.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.212-213');
  'four-demon-beetles', 'The Four Demon Beetles', 'Phoe''Anxth, Kmm''Anxth, Ti''Anxth and Dra''Anxth', NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon', NULL, NULL, 'Diabolic (evil)', NULL, '12 inches (0.3 m) long', NULL, '{"IQ":11,"ME":16,"MA":11,"PS":16,"PP":20,"PE":20,"PB":5,"Spd":18}', 277, 400, 500, 1000, NULL, 15, 12, '{"attacks":1,"initiative":1,"strike":2,"dodge":6}', 'Attacks are one each (bite, or eye beam for Kra); flying speed 66 (45 mph/72 km). All +5 on all saving throws. HP/SDC/MDC values are per beetle (four identical individuals).', NULL, NULL, 'Nightvision 120ft (total darkness), see/turn invisible, fly, bio-regen 1D6/melee, teleport 91%, dimensional teleport 74%, telepathy 120ft, all languages.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Four identical, immortal beetle-demons who exist purely to spread trouble and despair, always seeking new worlds to torment.', NULL, 'Everyone (widely hated)', 'Four identical demon beetles of Hades, each with a unique transformation attack; regenerate even from ashes unless sealed with holy water.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.213-214');
  'mantus', 'Mantus', NULL, 'King of the Dead', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '18th level Wizard, 13th level Diabolist, and 9th level Warlock (fire)', 18, 'Miscreant (evil)', NULL, '7 feet (2.1 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":26,"ME":24,"MA":23,"PS":37,"PP":25,"PE":25,"PB":14,"Spd":27}', 2800, 3100, 9000, 2400, NULL, 10, 13, '{"attacks":5,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":3}', 'Double flying speed. Impervious to horror factor; +2 on all saving throws. Deific powers cost double standard. Depression: forgets his own power, misses opportunities. Minions: the Mares (summon 2D6).', '[{"name":"All Science skills","pct":98},{"name":"All Rogue skills","pct":98}]', NULL, 'Nightvision 200ft, fly, turn invisible at will, metamorphosis: humanoid, fire/cold resistant (half damage), bio-regen 2D6x10/min, teleport 87%, dimensional teleport 61%.', 'All 1st-7th level Wizard spells; All power words, wards and symbols; All 1st-6th level fire elemental spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Studded leather armor, magically enhanced, A.R. 15, S.D.C. 750', NULL, 'Forlorn and depressed, dwelling on past glory; lacks the energy to fight for his crumbling power.', 'Amon, the Hidden One (Gods of Darkness)', 'His wife Mania; Charun (Mania''s lover)', 'An aging, depressed Demon Lord and King of the Dead, once glorious, now abandoned by allies and betrayed by his wife.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.214-215');
  'mania', 'Mania', NULL, 'Queen of the Dead', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '20th level Mind Mage', 20, 'Miscreant (evil)', NULL, '6 feet (1.8 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":28,"ME":22,"MA":24,"PS":26,"PP":25,"PE":24,"PB":35,"Spd":27}', 4200, 3900, 8000, 1400, 566, 8, 14, '{"attacks":4,"strike":2,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"damage":2}', 'Double speed when flying. Natural A.R. 8, or thin veil of chain A.R. 15 S.D.C. 1,000. +5 to save vs horror factor, +2 on all saving throws, 89% to charm/impress. Manic personality. Deific powers cost double standard. Minions: Succubus & Incubus (summon 4D6).', '[{"name":"All rogue skills","pct":80},{"name":"Card shark","pct":98},{"name":"Disguise","pct":90},{"name":"Intelligence","pct":90},{"name":"Interrogation","pct":90},{"name":"All lores","pct":90},{"name":"Dance","pct":90},{"name":"Sing","pct":90}]', NULL, 'Nightvision 200ft, resistant to fire (half damage), fly, metamorphosis: animal or humanoid, dimensional teleport 31%, bio-regen 1D6x10/min, all languages.', NULL, 'All psionics from every category, including super psionics', NULL, NULL, 'Magical chain veil armor, A.R. 15, S.D.C. 1,000', NULL, 'Constantly busy and plotting; scorns laziness; wants her husband Mantus dead by her own hand.', 'Charun (her lover)', 'Tolmet (a lesser goddess who hates her)', 'Demon Lord ruling the city of Allvice with Succubus and Incubus citizens; wife of Mantus, plotting his overthrow with her lover Charun.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.215-216');
  'murmur', 'Murmur', NULL, NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '20th level Knight', 20, 'Miscreant (evil)', NULL, '18 feet (5.5 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":23,"ME":26,"MA":30,"PS":32,"PP":26,"PE":28,"PB":30,"Spd":33}', 4200, 4800, 8500, 1000, NULL, 9, 10, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":2,"strike":4,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"damage":8}', '+4 on all saving throws, 94% to charm or impress. Self-Blind: compulsively lies and denies it. Deific powers cost double standard. Minions: Couril (summon 4D6) and Banshee (summon 1D6).', '[{"name":"Play musical instruments (each)","pct":90},{"name":"Dance","pct":85},{"name":"Sing","pct":85},{"name":"Public speaking","pct":85},{"name":"Juggle","pct":85},{"name":"All Military skills","pct":85}]', NULL, 'Nightvision 200ft, fire/cold resistant (half damage), all languages, bio-regen 1D4x10/min, teleport 55%, dimensional teleport 22%.', '1st-3rd level Wizard spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Short sword, +6 to strike, 1D6x10 damage; The Pipes of Murmur (magic weapon: soothes -4 initiative; sleep 1D4x10 melee rounds; discord -4 initiative/-2 combat bonuses; Faeries'' Dance; save vs magic 15+); Gold plate armor, A.R. 18, S.D.C. 1,550', NULL, 'Vain and power-crazed; believes himself cultured and respected while lying constantly and denying it when confronted.', 'Yin-Sloth (currently working with)', 'Distrusted by all other Demon Lords, especially hated by Mormo', 'Demon Lord and patron of music who rules a remote tower in Hades, luring minstrels there under false promises of easy lodging.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.216-217');
  'ramsea', 'Ramsea', NULL, 'Murmur''s black vulture (steed)', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Magical Beast (Giant Vulture)', NULL, NULL, 'Miscreant', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{"IQ":16,"Spd":220}', 334, 810, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, '{"attacks":3,"initiative":3,"strike":3,"parry":3,"dodge":3}', '+4 to save vs magic.', NULL, NULL, 'Flight; huge black vulture serving as Murmur''s steed and constant companion.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Murmur''s loyal, constant mount and companion.', 'Murmur (owner)', NULL, 'A huge, magical black vulture that serves as Murmur''s steed and most constant companion.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.217');
  'mormo', 'Mormo', NULL, 'Lord of the Ghouls', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '15th level Juggler and Knife Thrower, and 8th level Wizard', 15, 'Diabolic (evil)', NULL, '6 feet (1.8 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":21,"ME":20,"MA":23,"PS":28,"PP":21,"PE":24,"PB":6,"Spd":22}', 4000, 3000, 7000, 900, NULL, 9, 9, '{"attacks":11,"initiative":6,"strike":6,"parry":7,"dodge":7,"pull":5}', 'Critical strike on natural roll of 13+; triple damage from behind; impervious to horror factor; 89% to charm or impress. Known publicly as Mormo Quison. Greed: obsessed with ancient runed artifacts and jewelry. Deific powers cost double standard. Minions: ghouls & nasu (summon 1D6x100) plus bred ravens (Mormo Ravens: avg 3D6+2 hp, 2D6+6 S.D.C., +6 dodge, +2 strike dropping objects, 1D4+3 I.Q. -- generic minion type, not a named individual).', '[{"name":"Juggling","pct":92},{"name":"Knife throwing (W.P. dagger)","pct":92},{"name":"Paired weapons","pct":92},{"name":"Targeting","pct":92},{"name":"All Rogue/Thief skills","pct":92},{"name":"All math skills","pct":98}]', NULL, 'Nightvision 1000ft, metamorphosis into raven only (fly spd 20), all languages, prowl 60%, keen smell/taste, track by smell 60% (+15% blood/decay), bio-regen 1D6x10/min, dimensional teleport 40%.', 'All Wizard spells levels 1-4; X-ray vision; Animate object; Fly as the eagle; Tongues; Mystic portal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Toothy dagger, +4 to strike, returns when thrown, 2D6+10 to mortals/3D6+20 to supernatural beings/4D6+40 to gods and Demon/Deevil Lords', NULL, 'Cruel, treacherous, socially ambitious among Western Empire nobility; secretly a cannibal; greedy for ancient artifacts and jewelry.', 'Tark (plotting against Yin-Sloth)', 'Murmur (hates his guts)', 'A fat, elegant Demon Lord who mingles with Western Empire nobility, secretly a cannibal, ruling ghoul- and nasu-populated islands in Hades.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.217-218');
  'abrasax', 'Abrasax', NULL, 'the Insatiable', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Demon Lord', '10th level Wizard', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, '16 feet (5 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":16,"ME":15,"MA":19,"PS":36,"PP":20,"PE":21,"PB":3,"Spd":66}', 4000, 4600, 8600, 1330, NULL, 12, 16, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":1,"strike":2,"parry":4,"dodge":4}', 'Alt: 2 attacks/melee if using magic. +8 to save vs horror factor, +2 on all saving throws. Blood Lust: prone to berserker rages. Deific powers at regular cost. Minions: masses of Shedim (summon 1D4x10), plus Gallu Demon Bulls (summon 2D4) as officers.', '[{"name":"Literacy: Dragonese","pct":98},{"name":"Literacy: Elven","pct":98},{"name":"Lore: Faerie","pct":70}]', NULL, 'Turn/see invisible, nightvision 200ft, fire/cold resistant (half damage), bio-regen 1D4x10/min, metamorphosis: animal (hawk/lizard) or humanoid, teleport 80%, dimensional teleport 46%.', 'All 1st-6th level Wizard spells; Locate; Speed of the snail; Swords to snakes; Water to wine; Time hole', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Magical armor, A.R. 16, S.D.C. 1,800 (rarely worn)', NULL, 'Loud, obsessive, and prone to berserk rages; hates Kirgi the Rat God and rants about him to deflect suspicion from his own plots.', 'Has tried to ally with every faction in Hades', 'Kirgi, the Rat God', 'A rooster-headed Demon Lord ruling Shedim legions in the Baalgor Wastelands region of Hades, secretly plotting against every other Demon Lord.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.218-219');
  'high-lord-erloc', 'High Lord Erloc', NULL, 'King of the Gargoyles', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Gargoyle (lesser supernatural being, not a god)', '7th level soldier', 7, 'Miscreant', NULL, '18 feet (6 meters) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":11,"ME":17,"MA":12,"PS":34,"PP":27,"PE":28,"PB":9,"Spd":24}', 80, 80, NULL, 21, 40, 14, 16, '{"attacks":6,"initiative":3,"strike":2,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":3}', 'Flying speed 70. +6 to dodge while flying, +2 to roll with impact/fall, +3 on all saving throws, +10 to save vs horror factor. Damage: restrained punch 2D6 S.D.C., full punch/tail strike 5D6, power punch 1D6x10 (counts as 2 melee attacks), claws +2D4 with punch, bite 1D6.', NULL, NULL, 'Fly, glide, nightvision 220ft, see invisible, fire breath once/melee (4D6 S.D.C., 40ft range), leap 30ft, bio-regen 2D6 S.D.C./hp once per melee round.', NULL, 'Meditation; Mind block; Presence sense; Telepathy; Resist hunger; Resist fatigue; Resist thirst', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cocky braggart, glutton, torturer, and warrior king who rules by strength.', 'Lady Leeves (his queen); Powmer (his arch-mage)', NULL, 'A giant gargoyle lord who styles himself King of the Gargoyles, though his queen and arch-mage are whispered to be the true power.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.219-220');
  'lady-leeves', 'Lady Leeves', NULL, 'Queen of the Gargoyles', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Gargoyle (lesser supernatural being, not a god)', '10th level Earth Warlock', 10, 'Diabolic', NULL, '15 feet (4.6 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":16,"ME":15,"MA":18,"PS":26,"PP":24,"PE":28,"PB":10,"Spd":22}', 60, 70, NULL, 134, 40, 14, 16, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', 'Flying speed 80. +4 to dodge while flying, +4 to save vs magic, +3 on all other saving throws, +12 to save vs horror factor. Damage: restrained punch 2D6 S.D.C., full punch/tail strike 4D6, power punch 1D4x10 (counts as 2 melee attacks), claws +1D6, bite 1D4. Magic limited to earth elemental spells at 4th-level-warlock proficiency.', NULL, NULL, 'Fly, glide, nightvision 220ft, see/turn invisible, fire breath once/melee (4D6 S.D.C., 10ft range), teleport self 90%+1%/level (2400ft, 3x daily), dimensional teleport 50%+2%/level, bio-regen 4D6/melee.', 'All levels 1-3 earth elemental magic spells (4th-level-warlock proficiency)', 'Meditation; Mind block; Presence sense; Sense evil; Sense magic; Detect psionics; Healing touch; Exorcism; Telepathy; Resist hunger; Resist fatigue; Resist thirst', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cunning and treacherous; craves power and desires to rule both Hades and the Palladium world.', 'Powmer (mother, arch-mage); High Lord Erloc (consort/king)', 'Those who oppose her craving for power', 'Queen of the Gargoyles, a cunning and treacherous ruler whose enemies have a habit of disappearing or suddenly dying.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.220');
  'powmer', 'Powmer', NULL, 'The Arch-mage', 'palladium-fantasy', 'Gargoyle (lesser supernatural being, not a god)', '8th level Earth Warlock (average)', 8, 'Aberrant', 'Over 10,000 years old', '17 feet (5.2 m)', NULL, '{"IQ":16,"ME":19,"MA":12,"PS":28,"PP":22,"PE":24,"PB":9,"Spd":24}', 70, 50, NULL, 146, 30, 14, 16, '{"attacks":4,"initiative":3,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":2}', 'Flying speed 60. +4 to dodge while flying, +4 to save vs magic, +3 on all other saving throws, +12 to save vs horror factor. Damage: restrained punch 2D6 S.D.C., full punch/tail strike 4D6, power punch 1D4x10 (counts as 2 melee attacks), claws +1D6, bite 1D4. Said to hold a favor owed by the god Set.', NULL, NULL, 'Fly, glide, nightvision 220ft, see/turn invisible, fire breath once/melee (4D6 S.D.C., 10ft range), teleport self 90%+1%/level (2400ft, 3x daily), dimensional teleport 50%+2%/level, bio-regen 4D6/melee.', 'All levels 1-3 earth elemental magic spells (4th-level-warlock proficiency)', 'Meditation; Mind block; Presence sense; Sense evil; Sense magic; Detect psionics; Healing touch; Exorcism; Telepathy; Resist hunger; Resist fatigue; Resist thirst', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Believed to be the true power behind the Gargoyle throne, working behind her daughter Queen Leeves.', 'Lady Leeves (daughter, queen); High Lord Erloc', NULL, 'The oldest living gargoyle, said to hold a pact of immortality from the gods of Taut and a favor owed by Set himself.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.220');
  'kym-nark-mar', 'Kym-nark-mar', 'Kym-nark-mar t''Gransk', NULL, 'palladium-fantasy', 'God-Dragon (Deity)', '22nd level Wizard and 19th level Rune Mage', 22, 'Unprincipled (good)', NULL, '800 feet (243 m) long, 260 feet (80 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":41,"ME":30,"MA":30,"PS":67,"PP":30,"PE":30,"PB":29,"Spd":88}', 22500, 19500, 40000, 22000, NULL, 17, 17, '{"attacks":9,"initiative":5,"strike":2,"parry":4,"dodge":4,"pull":12}', 'Flying speed 220 (150mph/241km). Impervious to horror factor, 99% to charm or impress. Deific powers at regular cost. Vulnerable to magic-based attacks (keeps himself open to all magical energies to monitor the universe). Dragon Parts: blood forms an unbreakable, razor-sharp crystalline substance worth millions of gold.', '[{"name":"Card Shark","pct":99}]', NULL, 'Astral travel, dragon''s lair/dimensional travel/instinctive dimensional magic, impervious to heat/cold/fire, senses ley lines and runes, sees unlimited distance, all languages including rune, bio-regen 2D6x100/min, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 92%.', 'All Wizard spells; Knowledge of wards, power words, etc.; Can create rune weapons (Holy Weapons), used sparingly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Rarely interferes with mortals; contemplative hoarder of knowledge who only intervenes when something is fundamentally wrong.', 'Kormath; Most Gods of Light', 'The Old Ones', 'One of the four God-Dragons of Dragonwright, symbol of wisdom, power and magic, who dwells in an icy deific realm contemplating the universe.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.223-224');
  'zandragal', 'Zandragal', NULL, 'god of war', 'palladium-fantasy', 'God-Dragon (Deity)', '24th level Warlock (fire/earth/air) and 18th level Summoner', 24, 'Anarchist (selfish)', NULL, '950 feet (290 m) long, 275 feet (84 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":32,"ME":30,"MA":25,"PS":58,"PP":28,"PE":28,"PB":27,"Spd":88}', 21000, 15000, 36000, 12000, NULL, 17, 18, '{"attacks":12,"initiative":8,"strike":4,"parry":3,"dodge":3,"pull":10}', 'Flying speed 220 (150mph/241km). Impervious to horror factor, 98% to charm or impress. Deific powers at regular cost plus: Control Tectonics (200 P.P.E.); Zandragal''s Armor of Defiance on followers'' armor (+3 A.R., +200/+100/+50 S.D.C., +5 save vs magic, fire invulnerability; 500 P.P.E.). Manifests as Lady Annak Zeftan, a knight avatar (knight skill 98%). Dragon Parts: scales are ''red metal'' (unbreakable, half the weight of iron); blood is molten, hardens into red metal armor (3x S.D.C. of normal metal), worth 100,000+ gold/lb.', '[{"name":"All military skills","pct":98},{"name":"All espionage skills","pct":98}]', NULL, 'Astral travel, dragon''s lair/dimensional travel/instinctive dimensional magic, impervious to heat/cold/fire, senses ley lines, all languages including rune, bio-regen 2D6x100/min, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 92%.', 'All fire, earth and air elemental spells; All Summoner Circles', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'An enthusiastic, involved war-goddess who protects Dragonwright followers and expects agreements honored to the exact letter.', 'Kym-nark-mar; Kormath', 'Dark gods and promoters of evil', 'One of the four God-Dragons of Dragonwright, goddess of war, who watches mortal battles from her mountain deific realm like a chessboard.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.224-225');
  'kormath', 'Kormath', NULL, 'also spelled Kormeth or Korameth', 'palladium-fantasy', 'God-Dragon (Deity)', '23rd level Celestial Mathematician and 19th level Warlock (water/air)', 23, 'Principled (good)', NULL, '720 feet (220 m) long, 240 feet (73 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":36,"ME":32,"MA":27,"PS":62,"PP":28,"PE":30,"PB":24,"Spd":88}', 19600, 18400, 38000, 16900, NULL, 17, 16, '{"attacks":7,"initiative":4,"strike":3,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":10}', 'Flying speed 220 (150mph/241km). Impervious to horror factor, 99% to charm or impress. Deific powers at regular cost plus: Control Weather: Local (25 P.P.E.); Deific Curse: Dragon Curse, forces victim to blurt the curse in place of any profanity (400 P.P.E.). Greed: still lusts for power, souls and worshippers. Dragon Parts: never lets any part fall to others; blood becomes ''White Metal'' after ~1 year, reputedly more powerful than other God-Dragons'' blood.', '[{"name":"All communication skills","pct":98},{"name":"All art skills","pct":98},{"name":"All science skills","pct":98}]', NULL, 'Astral travel, dragon''s lair/dimensional travel/instinctive dimensional magic, impervious to heat/cold/fire, senses ley lines, sees with a hawk''s vision, all languages including rune, bio-regen 3D6x100/min, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 92%.', 'All water and air elemental spells', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Reserved philosopher-advisor who trusts mortals'' own judgment; prefers subtle hints and omens over direct contact.', 'The righteous, across many pantheons he visits as emissary', 'Cults of the dead; The Old Ones; The Pantheon of Taut', 'One of the four God-Dragons of Dragonwright, symbol of peace, tranquility and law, who keeps philosophical distance from mortal affairs.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.225-226');
  'styphon', 'Styphon', NULL, 'the Black, the Corruptor', 'palladium-fantasy', 'God-Dragon (Deity)', '20th level Mind Mage, 12th level Diabolist and Summoner', 20, 'Miscreant (evil)', NULL, '1,300 feet (395 m) long, 320 feet (98 m) tall', NULL, '{"IQ":29,"ME":44,"MA":19,"PS":70,"PP":30,"PE":30,"PB":23,"Spd":88}', 20500, 23500, 44000, 20900, 3000, 17, 19, '{"attacks":10,"initiative":6,"strike":1,"parry":2,"dodge":2,"pull":8}', 'Flying speed 293 (200mph/321km). Impervious to horror factor. Deific powers at regular cost plus Open Continental Rift (rips a ley line into an interdimensional opening, sends victims randomly across dimensions; 12,500 P.P.E. plus Severe Body Investment). Fierce Joy: takes a liking to followers who kill joyfully. Manifests as Stavros, a black-skinned elf avatar who avoids violence. Dragon Parts: unconcerned with lost parts (decay in 24 hrs); blood becomes ''Black Metal'' after ~6 hours, invulnerable to all but magic, double S.D.C. armor, sells 80,000+ gold/lb.', '[{"name":"Card Shark","pct":99}]', NULL, 'Astral travel, dragon''s lair/dimensional travel/instinctive dimensional magic, impervious to heat/cold/fire, radar sense (detects objects for miles through obstructions), all languages including rune, bio-regen 2D6x100/min, teleport 98%, dimensional teleport 92%.', 'All Wards power words; All symbols; All wards; All circles', 'All psionic categories', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Dark, chaotic and violent; demands blood and battle rather than quiet prayer from worshippers.', 'Fellow God-Dragons (guards Dragonwright as his own toy)', 'None at present (actively seeks ''suitable'' enemies)', 'One of the four God-Dragons of Dragonwright, symbol of death and pestilence, dwelling in a deific realm of war machines and fire.', 'Palladium Fantasy Dragons and Gods p.226-228');
  'lord-of-the-deep', 'The Lord of the Deep', NULL, 'Alien Intelligence; also known as the Kraken and the Leviathan', 'rifts', 'Alien Intelligence', 'Alien Intelligence', 15, 'Diabolic', NULL, 'Main body 500 feet (152 m) tall, 700 feet (210 m) wide at the base; eight main tentacles stretch from 200 feet (61 m) up to 2000 miles (3200 km)', '10,000 tons', '{"IQ":30,"ME":30,"MA":22,"PS":60,"PP":20,"PE":24,"PB":2,"Spd":6}', NULL, NULL, 500000, 10000, 4000, NULL, 18, '{"attacks":3}', 'Main body: cannot dodge attacks; +8 to save vs magic and psionics; +15 to save vs horror factor. In the Astral Realm it manifests as a mound of flesh with 30,000 S.D.C. and 20,000 hit points instead of M.D.C. Its eight Reachers (main tentacles) are treated as separate combat entities: Main Tentacle M.D.C. 1D4x1000 (amount needed to sever), regenerates in 1D4 days; Sub-Tentacles 200 M.D.C. each (3D6x10 per giant tentacle). Main tentacle attacks once/melee at +1 to strike, +2 to dodge, range up to 2000 miles; six sets of sub-tentacles can each attack six times/melee within 200 feet, at +4 to strike, +6 to parry, +4 to pull punch. Tentacles impervious to horror factor except vs magic weapons (H.F. 9), creatures of magic/demigods/godlings (H.F. 11), or gods and alien intelligences (H.F. 13). Regenerates 1D4x100 M.D.C. per melee round; damage from magic instead regenerates at only 1D4x100 per HOUR.', '[{"name":"O.C.C. equivalent of all medical skills","pct":90},{"name":"Land navigation","pct":90},{"name":"Magic lore","pct":90}]', 'Most normal skills are meaningless to it; magically knows all languages.', 'Impervious to normal cold/heat/fire/disease/radiation/pressure; breathes without air; astral projection; climb 60%/50%; mystic sense (2000ft radius, sees invisible/shadow-melded/4th-dimensional beings); nightvision 2000ft.', 'All spells levels 1-10; Calm storms; Summon entity; Summon storm; Close rift; Dimensional portal; Teleport: superior', 'All sensitive powers (equal to an 11th level psionic; master psionic for save purposes)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Utterly alien and unmoved by pleas, threats or flattery; responds only with force; keeps any human-like thoughts to itself.', 'Cult of the Deep (its worshippers); Rumored ties to the Horune D-bee pirates; Possible unconfirmed contact with the Old Ones, the Conqueror, or beings imprisoned by the gods', NULL, 'A colossal alien intelligence lurking beneath the Marianas Trench, an energy vampire that grows by draining P.P.E. from victims and mutates captives into new predator races.', 'Rifts World Book 7: Underseas p.43-44');




